window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a435-41d2656e4f01972b.json"]={sha256:"41d2656e4f01972b6e3b32ccfcb8ac7f6f1b58918d82bb6c9dca52f6217f6f03",value:{"id":"a435","title":"光學原子鐘真空與雷射系統","titleEn":"Optical atomic-clock vacuum and laser systems","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以 ⁸⁷Sr 光晶格鐘為對象，從品質因數與艾倫偏差 σ_y(τ) ∝ 1/(Q·SNR·√τ) 出發，建置原子冷卻與 813 nm 魔術波長晶格、超高真空腔與放氣預算、698 nm 鐘雷射與 ULE 腔，再量化黑體輻射、晶格光位移與密度位移，最後以光纖雜訊消除、鐘比對與系統不確定度表完成可交接的光鐘工程。","summaryEn":"Using the ⁸⁷Sr optical lattice clock as the object, this course starts from the quality factor and the Allan deviation σ_y(τ) ∝ 1/(Q·SNR·√τ), builds atom cooling and the 813 nm magic-wavelength lattice, the ultrahigh-vacuum chamber with its outgassing budget, the 698 nm clock laser with its ULE cavity, then quantifies blackbody, lattice light and density shifts, and closes with fibre-noise cancellation, clock comparison and a systematic-uncertainty table for a hand-over-ready optical clock.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-precision-metrology","subcategoryTitle":"光頻標準、慣性感測與干涉量測","subcategoryTitleEn":"Optical frequency standards, inertial sensing and interferometric metrology","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-precision-metrology","learningTags":["optics","optics-precision-metrology","laser"],"architectureFamily":"laser","architectureNodes":[["鍶原子爐與季曼減速器","Strontium oven and Zeeman slower"],["461/689 nm 冷卻雷射與磁光阱","461/689 nm cooling lasers and MOTs"],["813 nm 魔術波長光晶格","813 nm magic-wavelength lattice"],["698 nm 鐘雷射與 ULE 腔（PDH）","698 nm clock laser with ULE cavity (PDH)"],["超高真空腔、離子／NEG 幫浦與溫控","UHV chamber, ion/NEG pumps and temperature control"],["頻率梳與鐘比對","Frequency comb and clock comparison"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,4],[1,4],[2,4],[3,4],[3,5],[5,3]],"diagram":{"type":"laser","labels":["鍶原子爐與季曼減速器","461/689 nm 冷卻雷射與磁光阱","813 nm 魔術波長光晶格","698 nm 鐘雷射與 ULE 腔（PDH）","超高真空腔、離子／NEG 幫浦與溫控"],"labelsEn":["Strontium oven and Zeeman slower","461/689 nm cooling lasers and MOTs","813 nm magic-wavelength lattice","698 nm clock laser with ULE cavity (PDH)","UHV chamber, ion/NEG pumps and temperature control"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"鍶晶格鐘設計核對：鐘躍遷 ν = 429.228 THz，探測線寬 1 Hz（Q = 4.3×10¹⁴），N = 1000 個原子（SNR = 31.6），週期 T_c = 1.5 s：量子投影雜訊極限 σ_y(1 s) ≈ √1.5/(π×4.3×10¹⁴×31.6) ≈ 2.9×10⁻¹⁷；若鐘雷射與迪克效應把 1 s 穩定度限制在 2×10⁻¹⁶，平均到 1×10⁻¹⁸ 需 (2×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 4×10⁴ s ≈ 11 小時。真空：烘烤後放氣 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²)×3000 cm² = 3×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s，抽速 50 L/s 給 6×10⁻¹¹ mbar，晶格壽命約 80 s。鐘雷射腔：L = 100 mm、F = 3×10⁵，FSR 1.50 GHz、線寬 5.0 kHz，1×10⁻¹⁶ 的穩定度對應腔長 10 am。黑體輻射：300 K 位移 −5×10⁻¹⁵，要把不確定度壓到 5×10⁻¹⁹ 需腔溫知道到 7.5 mK。系統預算合成 9.3×10⁻¹⁹。光纖：10 m、1 K 的漂移在 100 s 內給 3.3×10⁻¹⁵，光纖雜訊消除為必要。所有數值皆為教學假設，不代表任何實驗室的實際評估。","textEn":"Strontium lattice-clock design check: clock transition ν = 429.228 THz, probe linewidth 1 Hz (Q = 4.3×10¹⁴), N = 1000 atoms (SNR = 31.6), cycle T_c = 1.5 s: the quantum-projection limit is σ_y(1 s) ≈ √1.5/(π×4.3×10¹⁴×31.6) ≈ 2.9×10⁻¹⁷; if clock-laser noise and the Dick effect limit the 1 s stability to 2×10⁻¹⁶, averaging to 1×10⁻¹⁸ takes (2×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 4×10⁴ s ≈ 11 hours. Vacuum: baked outgassing 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²)×3000 cm² = 3×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s with 50 L/s pumping gives 6×10⁻¹¹ mbar and a lattice lifetime near 80 s. Clock-laser cavity: L = 100 mm, F = 3×10⁵, FSR 1.50 GHz, linewidth 5.0 kHz, and 1×10⁻¹⁶ stability corresponds to 10 am of cavity length. Blackbody: the 300 K shift is −5×10⁻¹⁵, and holding its uncertainty to 5×10⁻¹⁹ requires the chamber temperature to be known to 7.5 mK. The systematic budget combines to 9.3×10⁻¹⁹. Fibre: 10 m with a 1 K drift over 100 s gives 3.3×10⁻¹⁵, so fibre-noise cancellation is mandatory. All values are teaching assumptions, not any laboratory's actual evaluation.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a435-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「光鐘的系統邊界與穩定度極限」與「原子冷卻、晶格囚禁與蘭姆—迪克區」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"System boundaries and stability limits of an optical clock\" and \"Atom cooling, lattice trapping and the Lamb–Dicke regime\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a435-v12-01","title":"光鐘的系統邊界與穩定度極限：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"System boundaries and stability limits of an optical clock: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「鐘躍遷品質因數與艾倫偏差」如何決定光學原子鐘真空與雷射系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Clock-transition quality factor and Allan deviation” determines the key performance of “Optical atomic-clock vacuum and laser systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"光學原子鐘用一束窄線寬雷射去探測原子中一條極窄的躍遷（⁸⁷Sr 的 ¹S₀–³P₀，698 nm，429.228 THz，自然線寬約 1 mHz），把原子的激發機率當作誤差訊號，週期性地修正雷射頻率，再用頻率梳把光頻除頻到可計數的射頻。它比銫鐘好的原因是品質因數 Q = ν/Δν 高了約五個數量級：光頻 4×10¹⁴ Hz 對微波 9×10⁹ Hz。穩定度以艾倫偏差描述，σ_y(τ) ≈ (1/(π·Q·SNR))·√(T_c/τ)，其中 SNR 由原子數的量子投影雜訊限制（SNR = √N），T_c 是包含裝載與探測的鐘週期。系統邊界因此是：真空中一團冷原子、一支鐘雷射、一套冷卻與晶格雷射、以及把光頻帶出去的頻率梳。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「鐘躍遷品質因數與艾倫偏差」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An optical atomic clock probes an extremely narrow transition in an atom (for ⁸⁷Sr the ¹S₀–³P₀ line at 698 nm, 429.228 THz, natural linewidth about 1 mHz) with a narrow-linewidth laser, uses the excitation probability as an error signal to correct the laser frequency periodically, and divides the optical frequency down to countable radio frequency with a frequency comb. It beats a caesium clock because the quality factor Q = ν/Δν is about five orders higher: 4×10¹⁴ Hz optical against 9×10⁹ Hz microwave. Stability is described by the Allan deviation σ_y(τ) ≈ (1/(π·Q·SNR))·√(T_c/τ), where SNR is limited by quantum projection noise of the atom number (SNR = √N) and T_c is the clock cycle including loading and probing. The system boundary is therefore a cloud of cold atoms in vacuum, a clock laser, a set of cooling and lattice lasers, and a comb that carries the optical frequency out. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Clock-transition quality factor and Allan deviation”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：取 ν = 429.228 THz、探測線寬 Δν = 1 Hz（約 0.8 s 的 Rabi 脈衝），Q = 4.3×10¹⁴；N = 1000 個原子，SNR = √1000 = 31.6；T_c = 1.5 s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With ν = 429.228 THz and a probe linewidth Δν = 1 Hz (a Rabi pulse of about 0.8 s), Q = 4.3×10¹⁴; with N = 1000 atoms, SNR = √1000 = 31.6; T_c = 1.5 s.","failure":"常見誤解：「光鐘比銫鐘準是因為雷射比微波源更穩定。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Optical clocks beat caesium clocks because lasers are more stable than microwave sources.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「鐘躍遷品質因數與艾倫偏差」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Clock-transition quality factor and Allan deviation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-01-k1","title":"光鐘的系統邊界與穩定度極限","titleEn":"System boundaries and stability limits of an optical clock","text":"光學原子鐘用一束窄線寬雷射去探測原子中一條極窄的躍遷（⁸⁷Sr 的 ¹S₀–³P₀，698 nm，429.228 THz，自然線寬約 1 mHz），把原子的激發機率當作誤差訊號，週期性地修正雷射頻率，再用頻率梳把光頻除頻到可計數的射頻。它比銫鐘好的原因是品質因數 Q = ν/Δν 高了約五個數量級：光頻 4×10¹⁴ Hz 對微波 9×10⁹ Hz。","textEn":"An optical atomic clock probes an extremely narrow transition in an atom (for ⁸⁷Sr the ¹S₀–³P₀ line at 698 nm, 429.228 THz, natural linewidth about 1 mHz) with a narrow-linewidth laser, uses the excitation probability as an error signal to correct the laser frequency periodically, and divides the optical frequency down to countable radio frequency with a frequency comb. It beats a caesium clock because the quality factor Q = ν/Δν is about five orders higher: 4×10¹⁴ Hz optical against 9×10⁹ Hz microwave.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：光鐘比銫鐘準是因為雷射比微波源更穩定。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Optical clocks beat caesium clocks because lasers are more stable than microwave sources. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光鐘的系統邊界與穩定度極限」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"System boundaries and stability limits of an optical clock\" is correct?","options":["光鐘比銫鐘準是因為雷射比微波源更穩定。","光學原子鐘用一束窄線寬雷射去探測原子中一條極窄的躍遷（⁸⁷Sr 的 ¹S₀–³P₀，698 nm，429.228 THz，自然線寬約 1 mHz），把原子的激發機率當作誤差訊號，週期性地修正雷射頻率，再用頻率梳把光頻除頻到可計數的射頻。","只要原子夠冷，不用晶格也能用秒級探測得到 Hz 級線寬。"],"optionsEn":["Optical clocks beat caesium clocks because lasers are more stable than microwave sources.","An optical atomic clock probes an extremely narrow transition in an atom (for ⁸⁷Sr the ¹S₀–³P₀ line at 698 nm, 429.228 THz, natural linewidth about 1 mHz) with a narrow-linewidth laser, uses the excitation probability as an error signal to correct the laser frequency periodically, and divides the optical frequency down to countable radio frequency with a frequency comb.","Cold enough atoms give hertz-level linewidths with second-long probes even without a lattice."],"answer":1,"explanation":"光學原子鐘用一束窄線寬雷射去探測原子中一條極窄的躍遷（⁸⁷Sr 的 ¹S₀–³P₀，698 nm，429.228 THz，自然線寬約 1 mHz），把原子的激發機率當作誤差訊號，週期性地修正雷射頻率，再用頻率梳把光頻除頻到可計數的射頻。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An optical atomic clock probes an extremely narrow transition in an atom (for ⁸⁷Sr the ¹S₀–³P₀ line at 698 nm, 429.228 THz, natural linewidth about 1 mHz) with a narrow-linewidth laser, uses the excitation probability as an error signal to correct the laser frequency periodically, and divides the optical frequency down to countable radio frequency with a frequency comb. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a435-v12-02","title":"光鐘的系統邊界與穩定度極限：定量估算","titleEn":"System boundaries and stability limits of an optical clock: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「鐘躍遷品質因數與艾倫偏差」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Clock-transition quality factor and Allan deviation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：取 ν = 429.228 THz、探測線寬 Δν = 1 Hz（約 0.8 s 的 Rabi 脈衝），Q = 4.3×10¹⁴；N = 1000 個原子，SNR = √1000 = 31.6；T_c = 1.5 s。σ_y(1 s) ≈ √1.5/(π×4.3×10¹⁴×31.6) ≈ 2.9×10⁻¹⁷，這是量子投影雜訊極限；要平均到 1×10⁻¹⁸ 需 τ = (2.9×10⁻¹⁷/10⁻¹⁸)² ≈ 830 s。實際上鐘雷射雜訊與迪克效應常把 1 s 穩定度拉到 2×10⁻¹⁶，此時到 1×10⁻¹⁸ 需 4×10⁴ s ≈ 11 小時。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With ν = 429.228 THz and a probe linewidth Δν = 1 Hz (a Rabi pulse of about 0.8 s), Q = 4.3×10¹⁴; with N = 1000 atoms, SNR = √1000 = 31.6; T_c = 1.5 s. Then σ_y(1 s) ≈ √1.5/(π×4.3×10¹⁴×31.6) ≈ 2.9×10⁻¹⁷, the quantum-projection-noise limit; averaging to 1×10⁻¹⁸ takes τ = (2.9×10⁻¹⁷/10⁻¹⁸)² ≈ 830 s. In practice clock-laser noise and the Dick effect often raise the 1 s stability to 2×10⁻¹⁶, and reaching 1×10⁻¹⁸ then takes 4×10⁴ s ≈ 11 hours. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以兩次交錯探測（鐘躍遷線形兩側的半高點）記錄激發機率的逐週期起伏，計算其標準差並與 1/(2√N) 的量子投影雜訊比較；再用頻率梳把鐘雷射與第二台鐘或超穩雷射拍頻計數，畫出艾倫偏差，確認在 1–100 s 區間斜率為 −1/2，且 1 s 的值落在 QPN 與鐘雷射限制之間。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record the cycle-to-cycle fluctuation of the excitation probability from two interleaved probes at the half-maximum points of the clock line, compute its standard deviation and compare with the 1/(2√N) quantum-projection noise; then count the beat between the clock laser and a second clock or ultrastable laser through the comb, plot the Allan deviation, and confirm a −1/2 slope from 1 to 100 s with the 1 s value lying between the QPN and clock-laser limits.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"取 ν = 429.228 THz、探測線寬 Δν = 1 Hz（約 0.8 s 的 Rabi 脈衝），Q = 4.3×10¹⁴；N = 1000 個原子，SNR = √1000 = 31.6；T_c = 1.5 s。σ_y(1 s) ≈ √1.5/(π×4.3×10¹⁴×31.6) ≈ 2.9×10⁻¹⁷，這是量子投影雜訊極限；要平均到 1×10⁻¹⁸ 需 τ = (2.9×10⁻¹⁷/10⁻¹⁸)² ≈ 830 s。實際上鐘雷射雜訊與迪克效應常把 1 s 穩定度拉到 2×10⁻¹⁶，此時到 1×10⁻¹⁸ 需 4×10⁴ s ≈ 11 小時。","textEn":"With ν = 429.228 THz and a probe linewidth Δν = 1 Hz (a Rabi pulse of about 0.8 s), Q = 4.3×10¹⁴; with N = 1000 atoms, SNR = √1000 = 31.6; T_c = 1.5 s. Then σ_y(1 s) ≈ √1.5/(π×4.3×10¹⁴×31.6) ≈ 2.9×10⁻¹⁷, the quantum-projection-noise limit; averaging to 1×10⁻¹⁸ takes τ = (2.9×10⁻¹⁷/10⁻¹⁸)² ≈ 830 s. In practice clock-laser noise and the Dick effect often raise the 1 s stability to 2×10⁻¹⁶, and reaching 1×10⁻¹⁸ then takes 4×10⁴ s ≈ 11 hours.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光鐘的系統邊界與穩定度極限」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"System boundaries and stability limits of an optical clock\", which statement holds?","options":["鐘雷射的線寬只取決於二極體雷射本身的品質。","準確度與穩定度是同一件事，艾倫偏差小就代表鐘準。","取 ν = 429.228 THz、探測線寬 Δν = 1 Hz（約 0.8 s 的 Rabi 脈衝），Q = 4.3×10¹⁴。"],"optionsEn":["The clock laser's linewidth depends only on the quality of the diode laser itself.","Accuracy and stability are the same thing, so a small Allan deviation means the clock is accurate.","With ν = 429.228 THz and a probe linewidth Δν = 1 Hz (a Rabi pulse of about 0.8 s), Q = 4.3×10¹⁴; with N = 1000 atoms, SNR = √1000 = 31.6; T_c = 1.5 s."],"answer":2,"explanation":"取 ν = 429.228 THz、探測線寬 Δν = 1 Hz（約 0.8 s 的 Rabi 脈衝），Q = 4.3×10¹⁴；N = 1000 個原子，SNR = √1000 = 31.6；T_c = 1.5 s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With ν = 429.228 THz and a probe linewidth Δν = 1 Hz (a Rabi pulse of about 0.8 s), Q = 4.3×10¹⁴; with N = 1000 atoms, SNR = √1000 = 31.6; T_c = 1.5 s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a435-v12-03","title":"光鐘的系統邊界與穩定度極限：量測與驗證","titleEn":"System boundaries and stability limits of an optical clock: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「鐘躍遷品質因數與艾倫偏差」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Clock-transition quality factor and Allan deviation” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以兩次交錯探測（鐘躍遷線形兩側的半高點）記錄激發機率的逐週期起伏，計算其標準差並與 1/(2√N) 的量子投影雜訊比較；再用頻率梳把鐘雷射與第二台鐘或超穩雷射拍頻計數，畫出艾倫偏差，確認在 1–100 s 區間斜率為 −1/2，且 1 s 的值落在 QPN 與鐘雷射限制之間。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record the cycle-to-cycle fluctuation of the excitation probability from two interleaved probes at the half-maximum points of the clock line, compute its standard deviation and compare with the 1/(2√N) quantum-projection noise; then count the beat between the clock laser and a second clock or ultrastable laser through the comb, plot the Allan deviation, and confirm a −1/2 slope from 1 to 100 s with the 1 s value lying between the QPN and clock-laser limits. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了提高 SNR 把原子數增加到 10⁵ 卻沒有擴大晶格體積，密度位移升到 10⁻¹⁶ 等級且隨裝載起伏，穩定度看似變好，準確度卻變差一個數量級。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Raising the atom number to 10⁵ for SNR without enlarging the lattice volume pushes the density shift to the 10⁻¹⁶ level and makes it fluctuate with loading; stability looks better while accuracy worsens by an order of magnitude.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以兩次交錯探測（鐘躍遷線形兩側的半高點）記錄激發機率的逐週期起伏，計算其標準差並與 1/(2√N) 的量子投影雜訊比較；再用頻率梳把鐘雷射與第二台鐘或超穩雷射拍頻計數，畫出艾倫偏差，確認在 1–100 s 區間斜率為 −1/2，且 1 s 的值落在 QPN 與鐘雷射限制之間。","textEn":"Record the cycle-to-cycle fluctuation of the excitation probability from two interleaved probes at the half-maximum points of the clock line, compute its standard deviation and compare with the 1/(2√N) quantum-projection noise; then count the beat between the clock laser and a second clock or ultrastable laser through the comb, plot the Allan deviation, and confirm a −1/2 slope from 1 to 100 s with the 1 s value lying between the QPN and clock-laser limits.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光鐘的系統邊界與穩定度極限」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"System boundaries and stability limits of an optical clock\"?","options":["以兩次交錯探測（鐘躍遷線形兩側的半高點）記錄激發機率的逐週期起伏，計算其標準差並與 1/(2√N) 的量子投影雜訊比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","單模光纖只是把光從 A 點送到 B 點，不會改變光的頻率。"],"optionsEn":["Record the cycle-to-cycle fluctuation of the excitation probability from two interleaved probes at the half-maximum points of the clock line, compute its standard deviation and compare with the 1/(2√N) quantum-projection noise.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A single-mode fibre merely moves light from A to B and cannot change its frequency."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以兩次交錯探測（鐘躍遷線形兩側的半高點）記錄激發機率的逐週期起伏，計算其標準差並與 1/(2√N) 的量子投影雜訊比較；再用頻率梳把鐘雷射與第二台鐘或超穩雷射拍頻計數，畫出艾倫偏差，確認在 1–100 s 區間斜率為 −1/2，且 1 s 的值落在 QPN 與鐘雷射限制之間。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record the cycle-to-cycle fluctuation of the excitation probability from two interleaved probes at the half-maximum points of the clock line, compute its standard deviation and compare with the 1/(2√N) quantum-projection noise; then count the beat between the clock laser and a second clock or ultrastable laser through the comb, plot the Allan deviation, and confirm a −1/2 slope from 1 to 100 s with the 1 s value lying between the QPN and clock-laser limits. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a435-v12-04","title":"光鐘的系統邊界與穩定度極限：失效診斷","titleEn":"System boundaries and stability limits of an optical clock: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「鐘躍遷品質因數與艾倫偏差」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Clock-transition quality factor and Allan deviation” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了提高 SNR 把原子數增加到 10⁵ 卻沒有擴大晶格體積，密度位移升到 10⁻¹⁶ 等級且隨裝載起伏，穩定度看似變好，準確度卻變差一個數量級。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Raising the atom number to 10⁵ for SNR without enlarging the lattice volume pushes the density shift to the 10⁻¹⁶ level and makes it fluctuate with loading; stability looks better while accuracy worsens by an order of magnitude. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：系統邊界因此是：真空中一團冷原子、一支鐘雷射、一套冷卻與晶格雷射、以及把光頻帶出去的頻率梳。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The system boundary is therefore a cloud of cold atoms in vacuum, a clock laser, a set of cooling and lattice lasers, and a comb that carries the optical frequency out.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「光鐘比銫鐘準是因為雷射比微波源更穩定。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Optical clocks beat caesium clocks because lasers are more stable than microwave sources.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了提高 SNR 把原子數增加到 10⁵ 卻沒有擴大晶格體積，密度位移升到 10⁻¹⁶ 等級且隨裝載起伏，穩定度看似變好，準確度卻變差一個數量級。","textEn":"Raising the atom number to 10⁵ for SNR without enlarging the lattice volume pushes the density shift to the 10⁻¹⁶ level and makes it fluctuate with loading; stability looks better while accuracy worsens by an order of magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光鐘的系統邊界與穩定度極限」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"System boundaries and stability limits of an optical clock\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","為了提高 SNR 把原子數增加到 10⁵ 卻沒有擴大晶格體積，密度位移升到 10⁻¹⁶ 等級且隨裝載起伏，穩定度看似變好，準確度卻變差一個數量級。","只要原子夠冷，不用晶格也能用秒級探測得到 Hz 級線寬。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Raising the atom number to 10⁵ for SNR without enlarging the lattice volume pushes the density shift to the 10⁻¹⁶ level and makes it fluctuate with loading.","Cold enough atoms give hertz-level linewidths with second-long probes even without a lattice."],"answer":1,"explanation":"為了提高 SNR 把原子數增加到 10⁵ 卻沒有擴大晶格體積，密度位移升到 10⁻¹⁶ 等級且隨裝載起伏，穩定度看似變好，準確度卻變差一個數量級。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Raising the atom number to 10⁵ for SNR without enlarging the lattice volume pushes the density shift to the 10⁻¹⁶ level and makes it fluctuate with loading; stability looks better while accuracy worsens by an order of magnitude. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a435-v12-05","title":"原子冷卻、晶格囚禁與蘭姆—迪克區：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Atom cooling, lattice trapping and the Lamb–Dicke regime: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「461/689 nm 磁光阱與 813 nm 魔術波長晶格」如何決定光學原子鐘真空與雷射系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “461/689 nm MOTs and the 813 nm magic-wavelength lattice” determines the key performance of “Optical atomic-clock vacuum and laser systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"鍶原子先在 461 nm 的 ¹S₀–¹P₁ 寬線（Γ = 2π×32 MHz）磁光阱中被減速冷卻到毫開爾文，再轉到 689 nm 的 ¹S₀–³P₁ 窄線（Γ = 2π×7.5 kHz）磁光阱冷到微開爾文，然後裝進 813 nm 的一維光晶格。813 nm 是魔術波長：鐘躍遷上下能階的交流極化率相等，晶格光對鐘頻率的一階位移為零。晶格使原子沿探測方向被侷限在遠小於 698 nm 的範圍內（蘭姆—迪克區），都卜勒與反衝位移消失，才能以秒級的探測時間看到 Hz 級的線寬。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「461/689 nm 磁光阱與 813 nm 魔術波長晶格」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Strontium atoms are first slowed and cooled to millikelvin in a magneto-optical trap on the broad 461 nm ¹S₀–¹P₁ line (Γ = 2π×32 MHz), then transferred to a MOT on the narrow 689 nm ¹S₀–³P₁ line (Γ = 2π×7.5 kHz) to reach microkelvin, and finally loaded into a one-dimensional optical lattice at 813 nm. 813 nm is the magic wavelength: the AC polarizabilities of the two clock states are equal, so the first-order lattice light shift of the clock frequency vanishes. The lattice confines the atoms along the probe direction to far less than 698 nm (the Lamb–Dicke regime), eliminating Doppler and recoil shifts so that second-long probes can reveal hertz-level linewidths. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “461/689 nm MOTs and the 813 nm magic-wavelength lattice”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：都卜勒極限 T_D = ħΓ/(2k_B)：461 nm 藍阱 T_D = 1.055×10⁻³⁴×2π×32×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³) = 0.77 mK；689 nm 紅阱 T_D = 180 nK，但反衝極限 T_r = ħ²k²/(m·k_B) = 464 nK（m = 86.9 u），所以紅阱實際落在約 1 µK。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The Doppler limit is T_D = ħΓ/(2k_B): for the 461 nm blue MOT T_D = 1.055×10⁻³⁴×2π×32×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³) = 0.77 mK; for the 689 nm red MOT T_D = 180 nK, but the recoil limit T_r = ħ²k²/(m·k_B) = 464 nK (m = 86.9 u), so the red MOT actually reaches about 1 µK.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要原子夠冷，不用晶格也能用秒級探測得到 Hz 級線寬。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Cold enough atoms give hertz-level linewidths with second-long probes even without a lattice.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「461/689 nm 磁光阱與 813 nm 魔術波長晶格」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “461/689 nm MOTs and the 813 nm magic-wavelength lattice”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-05-k1","title":"原子冷卻、晶格囚禁與蘭姆—迪克區","titleEn":"Atom cooling, lattice trapping and the Lamb–Dicke regime","text":"鍶原子先在 461 nm 的 ¹S₀–¹P₁ 寬線（Γ = 2π×32 MHz）磁光阱中被減速冷卻到毫開爾文，再轉到 689 nm 的 ¹S₀–³P₁ 窄線（Γ = 2π×7.5 kHz）磁光阱冷到微開爾文，然後裝進 813 nm 的一維光晶格。813 nm 是魔術波長：鐘躍遷上下能階的交流極化率相等，晶格光對鐘頻率的一階位移為零。","textEn":"Strontium atoms are first slowed and cooled to millikelvin in a magneto-optical trap on the broad 461 nm ¹S₀–¹P₁ line (Γ = 2π×32 MHz), then transferred to a MOT on the narrow 689 nm ¹S₀–³P₁ line (Γ = 2π×7.5 kHz) to reach microkelvin, and finally loaded into a one-dimensional optical lattice at 813 nm. 813 nm is the magic wavelength: the AC polarizabilities of the two clock states are equal, so the first-order lattice light shift of the clock frequency vanishes.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要原子夠冷，不用晶格也能用秒級探測得到 Hz 級線寬。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Cold enough atoms give hertz-level linewidths with second-long probes even without a lattice. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「原子冷卻、晶格囚禁與蘭姆—迪克區」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Atom cooling, lattice trapping and the Lamb–Dicke regime\" is correct?","options":["只要原子夠冷，不用晶格也能用秒級探測得到 Hz 級線寬。","真空只要「夠低」讓原子不被碰掉就好，對鐘的準確度沒有直接影響。","鍶原子先在 461 nm 的 ¹S₀–¹P₁ 寬線（Γ = 2π×32 MHz）磁光阱中被減速冷卻到毫開爾文，再轉到 689 nm 的 ¹S₀–³P₁ 窄線（Γ = 2π×7.5 kHz）磁光阱冷到微開爾文，然後裝進 813 nm 的一維光晶格。"],"optionsEn":["Cold enough atoms give hertz-level linewidths with second-long probes even without a lattice.","Vacuum only needs to be low enough to keep atoms from being knocked out and has no direct effect on clock accuracy.","Strontium atoms are first slowed and cooled to millikelvin in a magneto-optical trap on the broad 461 nm ¹S₀–¹P₁ line (Γ = 2π×32 MHz), then transferred to a MOT on the narrow 689 nm ¹S₀–³P₁ line (Γ = 2π×7.5 kHz) to reach microkelvin, and finally loaded into a one-dimensional optical lattice at 813 nm."],"answer":2,"explanation":"鍶原子先在 461 nm 的 ¹S₀–¹P₁ 寬線（Γ = 2π×32 MHz）磁光阱中被減速冷卻到毫開爾文，再轉到 689 nm 的 ¹S₀–³P₁ 窄線（Γ = 2π×7.5 kHz）磁光阱冷到微開爾文，然後裝進 813 nm 的一維光晶格。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Strontium atoms are first slowed and cooled to millikelvin in a magneto-optical trap on the broad 461 nm ¹S₀–¹P₁ line (Γ = 2π×32 MHz), then transferred to a MOT on the narrow 689 nm ¹S₀–³P₁ line (Γ = 2π×7.5 kHz) to reach microkelvin, and finally loaded into a one-dimensional optical lattice at 813 nm. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a435-v12-06","title":"原子冷卻、晶格囚禁與蘭姆—迪克區：定量估算","titleEn":"Atom cooling, lattice trapping and the Lamb–Dicke regime: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「461/689 nm 磁光阱與 813 nm 魔術波長晶格」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “461/689 nm MOTs and the 813 nm magic-wavelength lattice” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：都卜勒極限 T_D = ħΓ/(2k_B)：461 nm 藍阱 T_D = 1.055×10⁻³⁴×2π×32×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³) = 0.77 mK；689 nm 紅阱 T_D = 180 nK，但反衝極限 T_r = ħ²k²/(m·k_B) = 464 nK（m = 86.9 u），所以紅阱實際落在約 1 µK。813 nm 晶格的反衝能 E_r/h = 3.47 kHz（E_r/k_B = 167 nK）；井深 U = 50 E_r = 8.3 µK 時軸向囚禁頻率 ν_z = 2(E_r/h)·√(U/E_r) = 2×3.47×√50 ≈ 49 kHz，遠大於鐘躍遷線寬，滿足蘭姆—迪克條件。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The Doppler limit is T_D = ħΓ/(2k_B): for the 461 nm blue MOT T_D = 1.055×10⁻³⁴×2π×32×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³) = 0.77 mK; for the 689 nm red MOT T_D = 180 nK, but the recoil limit T_r = ħ²k²/(m·k_B) = 464 nK (m = 86.9 u), so the red MOT actually reaches about 1 µK. The 813 nm lattice recoil energy is E_r/h = 3.47 kHz (E_r/k_B = 167 nK); at a depth U = 50 E_r = 8.3 µK the axial trap frequency is ν_z = 2(E_r/h)·√(U/E_r) = 2×3.47×√50 ≈ 49 kHz, far above the clock linewidth, satisfying the Lamb–Dicke condition. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以飛行時間法量紅阱釋放後原子雲的膨脹速率得到溫度，確認約 1 µK；以鐘雷射掃描晶格中的運動邊帶，量得藍、紅邊帶與載波的頻率間隔即為 ν_z，與 49 kHz 的估計比較，並由邊帶振幅比推算平均振動量子數；調整晶格功率確認 ν_z 隨 √U 變化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the temperature by time-of-flight expansion of the cloud released from the red MOT, confirming about 1 µK; scan the clock laser across the motional sidebands in the lattice, read the blue- and red-sideband spacing from the carrier as ν_z, compare with the 49 kHz estimate and infer the mean vibrational quantum number from the sideband amplitude ratio; vary the lattice power and confirm that ν_z scales with √U.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"都卜勒極限 T_D = ħΓ/(2k_B)：461 nm 藍阱 T_D = 1.055×10⁻³⁴×2π×32×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³) = 0.77 mK；689 nm 紅阱 T_D = 180 nK，但反衝極限 T_r = ħ²k²/(m·k_B) = 464 nK（m = 86.9 u），所以紅阱實際落在約 1 µK。813 nm 晶格的反衝能 E_r/h = 3.47 kHz（E_r/k_B = 167 nK）；井深 U = 50 E_r = 8.3 µK 時軸向囚禁頻率 ν_z = 2(E_r/h)·√(U/E_r) = 2×3.47×√50 ≈ 49 kHz，遠大於鐘躍遷線寬，滿足蘭姆—迪克條件。","textEn":"The Doppler limit is T_D = ħΓ/(2k_B): for the 461 nm blue MOT T_D = 1.055×10⁻³⁴×2π×32×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³) = 0.77 mK; for the 689 nm red MOT T_D = 180 nK, but the recoil limit T_r = ħ²k²/(m·k_B) = 464 nK (m = 86.9 u), so the red MOT actually reaches about 1 µK. The 813 nm lattice recoil energy is E_r/h = 3.47 kHz (E_r/k_B = 167 nK); at a depth U = 50 E_r = 8.3 µK the axial trap frequency is ν_z = 2(E_r/h)·√(U/E_r) = 2×3.47×√50 ≈ 49 kHz, far above the clock linewidth, satisfying the Lamb–Dicke condition.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「原子冷卻、晶格囚禁與蘭姆—迪克區」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Atom cooling, lattice trapping and the Lamb–Dicke regime\", which statement holds?","options":["都卜勒極限 T_D = ħΓ/(2k_B)：461 nm 藍阱 T_D = 1.055×10⁻³⁴×2π×32×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³) = 0.77 mK。","只要實驗室溫度控制在 ±0.5 °C，黑體輻射位移就可以忽略。","單模光纖只是把光從 A 點送到 B 點，不會改變光的頻率。"],"optionsEn":["The Doppler limit is T_D = ħΓ/(2k_B): for the 461 nm blue MOT T_D = 1.055×10⁻³⁴×2π×32×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³) = 0.77 mK.","With the laboratory held to ±0.5 °C, the blackbody-radiation shift can be ignored.","A single-mode fibre merely moves light from A to B and cannot change its frequency."],"answer":0,"explanation":"都卜勒極限 T_D = ħΓ/(2k_B)：461 nm 藍阱 T_D = 1.055×10⁻³⁴×2π×32×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³) = 0.77 mK；689 nm 紅阱 T_D = 180 nK，但反衝極限 T_r = ħ²k²/(m·k_B) = 464 nK（m = 86.9 u），所以紅阱實際落在約 1 µK。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The Doppler limit is T_D = ħΓ/(2k_B): for the 461 nm blue MOT T_D = 1.055×10⁻³⁴×2π×32×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³) = 0.77 mK; for the 689 nm red MOT T_D = 180 nK, but the recoil limit T_r = ħ²k²/(m·k_B) = 464 nK (m = 86.9 u), so the red MOT actually reaches about 1 µK. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a435-v12-07","title":"原子冷卻、晶格囚禁與蘭姆—迪克區：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Atom cooling, lattice trapping and the Lamb–Dicke regime: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「461/689 nm 磁光阱與 813 nm 魔術波長晶格」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “461/689 nm MOTs and the 813 nm magic-wavelength lattice” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以飛行時間法量紅阱釋放後原子雲的膨脹速率得到溫度，確認約 1 µK；以鐘雷射掃描晶格中的運動邊帶，量得藍、紅邊帶與載波的頻率間隔即為 ν_z，與 49 kHz 的估計比較，並由邊帶振幅比推算平均振動量子數；調整晶格功率確認 ν_z 隨 √U 變化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the temperature by time-of-flight expansion of the cloud released from the red MOT, confirming about 1 µK; scan the clock laser across the motional sidebands in the lattice, read the blue- and red-sideband spacing from the carrier as ν_z, compare with the 49 kHz estimate and infer the mean vibrational quantum number from the sideband amplitude ratio; vary the lattice power and confirm that ν_z scales with √U. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：晶格光偏離魔術波長 0.1 nm（約 45 GHz）時，上下能階極化率不再相等，鐘頻率隨晶格功率線性漂移，每一次功率起伏都直接變成頻率誤差，準確度卡在 10⁻¹⁵。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: With the lattice light 0.1 nm (about 45 GHz) off the magic wavelength the two polarizabilities no longer match, the clock frequency drifts linearly with lattice power, every power fluctuation becomes a frequency error and accuracy stalls at 10⁻¹⁵.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以飛行時間法量紅阱釋放後原子雲的膨脹速率得到溫度，確認約 1 µK；以鐘雷射掃描晶格中的運動邊帶，量得藍、紅邊帶與載波的頻率間隔即為 ν_z，與 49 kHz 的估計比較，並由邊帶振幅比推算平均振動量子數；調整晶格功率確認 ν_z 隨 √U 變化。","textEn":"Measure the temperature by time-of-flight expansion of the cloud released from the red MOT, confirming about 1 µK; scan the clock laser across the motional sidebands in the lattice, read the blue- and red-sideband spacing from the carrier as ν_z, compare with the 49 kHz estimate and infer the mean vibrational quantum number from the sideband amplitude ratio; vary the lattice power and confirm that ν_z scales with √U.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「原子冷卻、晶格囚禁與蘭姆—迪克區」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Atom cooling, lattice trapping and the Lamb–Dicke regime\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以飛行時間法量紅阱釋放後原子雲的膨脹速率得到溫度，確認約 1 µK。","一台鐘的系統不確定度表做完一次，就能永久代表它的準確度。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure the temperature by time-of-flight expansion of the cloud released from the red MOT, confirming about 1 µK.","Once a clock's systematic table is completed, it represents the clock's accuracy permanently."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以飛行時間法量紅阱釋放後原子雲的膨脹速率得到溫度，確認約 1 µK；以鐘雷射掃描晶格中的運動邊帶，量得藍、紅邊帶與載波的頻率間隔即為 ν_z，與 49 kHz 的估計比較，並由邊帶振幅比推算平均振動量子數；調整晶格功率確認 ν_z 隨 √U 變化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the temperature by time-of-flight expansion of the cloud released from the red MOT, confirming about 1 µK; scan the clock laser across the motional sidebands in the lattice, read the blue- and red-sideband spacing from the carrier as ν_z, compare with the 49 kHz estimate and infer the mean vibrational quantum number from the sideband amplitude ratio; vary the lattice power and confirm that ν_z scales with √U. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a435-v12-08","title":"原子冷卻、晶格囚禁與蘭姆—迪克區：失效診斷","titleEn":"Atom cooling, lattice trapping and the Lamb–Dicke regime: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「461/689 nm 磁光阱與 813 nm 魔術波長晶格」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “461/689 nm MOTs and the 813 nm magic-wavelength lattice” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"晶格光偏離魔術波長 0.1 nm（約 45 GHz）時，上下能階極化率不再相等，鐘頻率隨晶格功率線性漂移，每一次功率起伏都直接變成頻率誤差，準確度卡在 10⁻¹⁵。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"With the lattice light 0.1 nm (about 45 GHz) off the magic wavelength the two polarizabilities no longer match, the clock frequency drifts linearly with lattice power, every power fluctuation becomes a frequency error and accuracy stalls at 10⁻¹⁵. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：晶格使原子沿探測方向被侷限在遠小於 698 nm 的範圍內（蘭姆—迪克區），都卜勒與反衝位移消失，才能以秒級的探測時間看到 Hz 級的線寬。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The lattice confines the atoms along the probe direction to far less than 698 nm (the Lamb–Dicke regime), eliminating Doppler and recoil shifts so that second-long probes can reveal hertz-level linewidths.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要原子夠冷，不用晶格也能用秒級探測得到 Hz 級線寬。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Cold enough atoms give hertz-level linewidths with second-long probes even without a lattice.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"晶格光偏離魔術波長 0.1 nm（約 45 GHz）時，上下能階極化率不再相等，鐘頻率隨晶格功率線性漂移，每一次功率起伏都直接變成頻率誤差，準確度卡在 10⁻¹⁵。","textEn":"With the lattice light 0.1 nm (about 45 GHz) off the magic wavelength the two polarizabilities no longer match, the clock frequency drifts linearly with lattice power, every power fluctuation becomes a frequency error and accuracy stalls at 10⁻¹⁵.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「原子冷卻、晶格囚禁與蘭姆—迪克區」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Atom cooling, lattice trapping and the Lamb–Dicke regime\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","真空只要「夠低」讓原子不被碰掉就好，對鐘的準確度沒有直接影響。","晶格光偏離魔術波長 0.1 nm（約 45 GHz）時，上下能階極化率不再相等，鐘頻率隨晶格功率線性漂移，每一次功率起伏都直接變成頻率誤差，準確度卡在 10⁻¹⁵。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Vacuum only needs to be low enough to keep atoms from being knocked out and has no direct effect on clock accuracy.","With the lattice light 0.1 nm (about 45 GHz) off the magic wavelength the two polarizabilities no longer match, the clock frequency drifts linearly with lattice power, every power fluctuation becomes a frequency error and accuracy stalls at 10⁻¹⁵."],"answer":2,"explanation":"晶格光偏離魔術波長 0.1 nm（約 45 GHz）時，上下能階極化率不再相等，鐘頻率隨晶格功率線性漂移，每一次功率起伏都直接變成頻率誤差，準確度卡在 10⁻¹⁵。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"With the lattice light 0.1 nm (about 45 GHz) off the magic wavelength the two polarizabilities no longer match, the clock frequency drifts linearly with lattice power, every power fluctuation becomes a frequency error and accuracy stalls at 10⁻¹⁵. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a435-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「超高真空系統：材料、烘烤與放氣預算」與「雷射系統：冷卻雷射、晶格雷射與鐘雷射」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"The ultrahigh-vacuum system: materials, bake-out and outgassing budget\" and \"Laser systems: cooling, lattice and clock lasers\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a435-v12-09","title":"超高真空系統：材料、烘烤與放氣預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"The ultrahigh-vacuum system: materials, bake-out and outgassing budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「鈦腔體、CF 法蘭與離子／NEG 幫浦」如何決定光學原子鐘真空與雷射系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Titanium chamber, CF flanges and ion/NEG pumps” determines the key performance of “Optical atomic-clock vacuum and laser systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"原子必須在超高真空中存活數秒以上：背景氣體碰撞會把原子踢出晶格並造成微小的頻率位移，所以腔體壓力要在 10⁻¹⁰ mbar 以下。腔體用 316L 不銹鋼或鈦（磁性低、放氣少），接口用 CF 法蘭與無氧銅墊圈，視窗為真空側鍍抗反射膜的熔融石英，鍍膜要同時覆蓋 461、689、698 與 813 nm。抽氣以離子幫浦加非蒸發吸氣劑（NEG）為主，無振動；組裝後整體在 150–200 °C 烘烤數天以去除壁面吸附的水，放氣率才能降到設計值。壓力由放氣總量除以有效抽速決定，所以材料面積、烘烤與導管傳導率共同決定最終真空。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「鈦腔體、CF 法蘭與離子／NEG 幫浦」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Atoms must survive for seconds in ultrahigh vacuum: background-gas collisions knock them out of the lattice and cause small frequency shifts, so chamber pressure must stay below 10⁻¹⁰ mbar. Chambers use 316L stainless steel or titanium (low magnetism, low outgassing), joints use CF flanges with oxygen-free copper gaskets, and viewports are fused silica anti-reflection coated on the vacuum side for 461, 689, 698 and 813 nm simultaneously. Pumping relies on ion pumps plus non-evaporable getters (NEG), both vibration-free; after assembly the whole system is baked at 150–200 °C for days to drive off adsorbed water before the outgassing rate reaches its design value. Pressure equals total outgassing divided by effective pumping speed, so material area, bake-out and conductance together decide the final vacuum. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Titanium chamber, CF flanges and ion/NEG pumps”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：烘烤後的不銹鋼放氣率約 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²)；內表面 3000 cm² 的腔體放氣 Q = 3×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s，有效抽速 50 L/s 時 p = Q/S = 6×10⁻¹¹ mbar。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Baked stainless steel outgasses at about 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²); a chamber with 3000 cm² of inner surface emits Q = 3×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s, and with 50 L/s effective pumping speed p = Q/S = 6×10⁻¹¹ mbar.","failure":"常見誤解：「真空只要「夠低」讓原子不被碰掉就好，對鐘的準確度沒有直接影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Vacuum only needs to be low enough to keep atoms from being knocked out and has no direct effect on clock accuracy.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「鈦腔體、CF 法蘭與離子／NEG 幫浦」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Titanium chamber, CF flanges and ion/NEG pumps”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-09-k1","title":"超高真空系統：材料、烘烤與放氣預算","titleEn":"The ultrahigh-vacuum system: materials, bake-out and outgassing budget","text":"原子必須在超高真空中存活數秒以上：背景氣體碰撞會把原子踢出晶格並造成微小的頻率位移，所以腔體壓力要在 10⁻¹⁰ mbar 以下。腔體用 316L 不銹鋼或鈦（磁性低、放氣少），接口用 CF 法蘭與無氧銅墊圈，視窗為真空側鍍抗反射膜的熔融石英，鍍膜要同時覆蓋 461、689、698 與 813 nm。","textEn":"Atoms must survive for seconds in ultrahigh vacuum: background-gas collisions knock them out of the lattice and cause small frequency shifts, so chamber pressure must stay below 10⁻¹⁰ mbar. Chambers use 316L stainless steel or titanium (low magnetism, low outgassing), joints use CF flanges with oxygen-free copper gaskets, and viewports are fused silica anti-reflection coated on the vacuum side for 461, 689, 698 and 813 nm simultaneously.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：真空只要「夠低」讓原子不被碰掉就好，對鐘的準確度沒有直接影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Vacuum only needs to be low enough to keep atoms from being knocked out and has no direct effect on clock accuracy. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「超高真空系統：材料、烘烤與放氣預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"The ultrahigh-vacuum system: materials, bake-out and outgassing budget\" is correct?","options":["原子必須在超高真空中存活數秒以上：背景氣體碰撞會把原子踢出晶格並造成微小的頻率位移，所以腔體壓力要在 10⁻¹⁰ mbar 以下。","真空只要「夠低」讓原子不被碰掉就好，對鐘的準確度沒有直接影響。","鐘雷射的線寬只取決於二極體雷射本身的品質。"],"optionsEn":["Atoms must survive for seconds in ultrahigh vacuum: background-gas collisions knock them out of the lattice and cause small frequency shifts, so chamber pressure must stay below 10⁻¹⁰ mbar.","Vacuum only needs to be low enough to keep atoms from being knocked out and has no direct effect on clock accuracy.","The clock laser's linewidth depends only on the quality of the diode laser itself."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原子必須在超高真空中存活數秒以上：背景氣體碰撞會把原子踢出晶格並造成微小的頻率位移，所以腔體壓力要在 10⁻¹⁰ mbar 以下。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Atoms must survive for seconds in ultrahigh vacuum: background-gas collisions knock them out of the lattice and cause small frequency shifts, so chamber pressure must stay below 10⁻¹⁰ mbar. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a435-v12-10","title":"超高真空系統：材料、烘烤與放氣預算：定量估算","titleEn":"The ultrahigh-vacuum system: materials, bake-out and outgassing budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「鈦腔體、CF 法蘭與離子／NEG 幫浦」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Titanium chamber, CF flanges and ion/NEG pumps” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：烘烤後的不銹鋼放氣率約 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²)；內表面 3000 cm² 的腔體放氣 Q = 3×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s，有效抽速 50 L/s 時 p = Q/S = 6×10⁻¹¹ mbar。未烘烤（1×10⁻¹⁰ mbar·L/(s·cm²)）則 p = 6×10⁻⁹ mbar，差 100 倍。在 1×10⁻¹⁰ mbar（室溫數密度 n = p/(k_B T) = 2.4×10¹² m⁻³）、碰撞損失係數 5×10⁻¹⁵ m³/s 時晶格壽命 τ = 1/(k·n) ≈ 80 s，對 1 s 的探測足夠。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Baked stainless steel outgasses at about 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²); a chamber with 3000 cm² of inner surface emits Q = 3×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s, and with 50 L/s effective pumping speed p = Q/S = 6×10⁻¹¹ mbar. Unbaked (1×10⁻¹⁰ mbar·L/(s·cm²)) it would be p = 6×10⁻⁹ mbar, 100 times worse. At 1×10⁻¹⁰ mbar (room-temperature number density n = p/(k_B T) = 2.4×10¹² m⁻³) and a collisional loss coefficient of 5×10⁻¹⁵ m³/s, the lattice lifetime is τ = 1/(k·n) ≈ 80 s, ample for 1 s probes. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以殘氣分析儀在烘烤前後記錄 H₂O（18）、H₂（2）與碳氫峰，確認烘烤後水峰下降兩個數量級；用離子幫浦電流與冷陰極規交叉核對壓力；最後量晶格中原子數隨保持時間的指數衰減，壽命應與 1/(k·n) 的估計同量級，若明顯偏短則表示有洩漏或虛漏。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record H₂O (mass 18), H₂ (mass 2) and hydrocarbon peaks with a residual-gas analyser before and after bake-out, confirming a two-order drop of the water peak; cross-check pressure from ion-pump current and a cold-cathode gauge; finally measure the exponential decay of atom number in the lattice versus hold time, whose lifetime should match the 1/(k·n) estimate, a clearly shorter value pointing to a leak or virtual leak.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"烘烤後的不銹鋼放氣率約 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²)；內表面 3000 cm² 的腔體放氣 Q = 3×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s，有效抽速 50 L/s 時 p = Q/S = 6×10⁻¹¹ mbar。未烘烤（1×10⁻¹⁰ mbar·L/(s·cm²)）則 p = 6×10⁻⁹ mbar，差 100 倍。在 1×10⁻¹⁰ mbar（室溫數密度 n = p/(k_B T) = 2.4×10¹² m⁻³）、碰撞損失係數 5×10⁻¹⁵ m³/s 時晶格壽命 τ = 1/(k·n) ≈ 80 s，對 1 s 的探測足夠。","textEn":"Baked stainless steel outgasses at about 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²); a chamber with 3000 cm² of inner surface emits Q = 3×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s, and with 50 L/s effective pumping speed p = Q/S = 6×10⁻¹¹ mbar. Unbaked (1×10⁻¹⁰ mbar·L/(s·cm²)) it would be p = 6×10⁻⁹ mbar, 100 times worse. At 1×10⁻¹⁰ mbar (room-temperature number density n = p/(k_B T) = 2.4×10¹² m⁻³) and a collisional loss coefficient of 5×10⁻¹⁵ m³/s, the lattice lifetime is τ = 1/(k·n) ≈ 80 s, ample for 1 s probes.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「超高真空系統：材料、烘烤與放氣預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"The ultrahigh-vacuum system: materials, bake-out and outgassing budget\", which statement holds?","options":["準確度與穩定度是同一件事，艾倫偏差小就代表鐘準。","烘烤後的不銹鋼放氣率約 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²)。","一台鐘的系統不確定度表做完一次，就能永久代表它的準確度。"],"optionsEn":["Accuracy and stability are the same thing, so a small Allan deviation means the clock is accurate.","Baked stainless steel outgasses at about 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²).","Once a clock's systematic table is completed, it represents the clock's accuracy permanently."],"answer":1,"explanation":"烘烤後的不銹鋼放氣率約 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²)；內表面 3000 cm² 的腔體放氣 Q = 3×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s，有效抽速 50 L/s 時 p = Q/S = 6×10⁻¹¹ mbar。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Baked stainless steel outgasses at about 1×10⁻¹² mbar·L/(s·cm²); a chamber with 3000 cm² of inner surface emits Q = 3×10⁻⁹ mbar·L/s, and with 50 L/s effective pumping speed p = Q/S = 6×10⁻¹¹ mbar. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a435-v12-11","title":"超高真空系統：材料、烘烤與放氣預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"The ultrahigh-vacuum system: materials, bake-out and outgassing budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「鈦腔體、CF 法蘭與離子／NEG 幫浦」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Titanium chamber, CF flanges and ion/NEG pumps” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以殘氣分析儀在烘烤前後記錄 H₂O（18）、H₂（2）與碳氫峰，確認烘烤後水峰下降兩個數量級；用離子幫浦電流與冷陰極規交叉核對壓力；最後量晶格中原子數隨保持時間的指數衰減，壽命應與 1/(k·n) 的估計同量級，若明顯偏短則表示有洩漏或虛漏。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record H₂O (mass 18), H₂ (mass 2) and hydrocarbon peaks with a residual-gas analyser before and after bake-out, confirming a two-order drop of the water peak; cross-check pressure from ion-pump current and a cold-cathode gauge; finally measure the exponential decay of atom number in the lattice versus hold time, whose lifetime should match the 1/(k·n) estimate, a clearly shorter value pointing to a leak or virtual leak. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：視窗鍍膜只為 698 nm 最佳化，461 nm 的反射率達 8%，散射的藍光打在腔壁與原子上造成光位移與載入效率下降；更換視窗意味著破真空、重新烘烤並損失數週。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Viewport coatings optimised only for 698 nm reflect 8% at 461 nm, and the scattered blue light hitting walls and atoms causes light shifts and poor loading; replacing the windows means breaking vacuum, rebaking and losing weeks.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以殘氣分析儀在烘烤前後記錄 H₂O（18）、H₂（2）與碳氫峰，確認烘烤後水峰下降兩個數量級；用離子幫浦電流與冷陰極規交叉核對壓力；最後量晶格中原子數隨保持時間的指數衰減，壽命應與 1/(k·n) 的估計同量級，若明顯偏短則表示有洩漏或虛漏。","textEn":"Record H₂O (mass 18), H₂ (mass 2) and hydrocarbon peaks with a residual-gas analyser before and after bake-out, confirming a two-order drop of the water peak; cross-check pressure from ion-pump current and a cold-cathode gauge; finally measure the exponential decay of atom number in the lattice versus hold time, whose lifetime should match the 1/(k·n) estimate, a clearly shorter value pointing to a leak or virtual leak.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「超高真空系統：材料、烘烤與放氣預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"The ultrahigh-vacuum system: materials, bake-out and outgassing budget\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","光鐘比銫鐘準是因為雷射比微波源更穩定。","以殘氣分析儀在烘烤前後記錄 H₂O（18）、H₂（2）與碳氫峰，確認烘烤後水峰下降兩個數量級。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Optical clocks beat caesium clocks because lasers are more stable than microwave sources.","Record H₂O (mass 18), H₂ (mass 2) and hydrocarbon peaks with a residual-gas analyser before and after bake-out, confirming a two-order drop of the water peak."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以殘氣分析儀在烘烤前後記錄 H₂O（18）、H₂（2）與碳氫峰，確認烘烤後水峰下降兩個數量級；用離子幫浦電流與冷陰極規交叉核對壓力；最後量晶格中原子數隨保持時間的指數衰減，壽命應與 1/(k·n) 的估計同量級，若明顯偏短則表示有洩漏或虛漏。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record H₂O (mass 18), H₂ (mass 2) and hydrocarbon peaks with a residual-gas analyser before and after bake-out, confirming a two-order drop of the water peak; cross-check pressure from ion-pump current and a cold-cathode gauge; finally measure the exponential decay of atom number in the lattice versus hold time, whose lifetime should match the 1/(k·n) estimate, a clearly shorter value pointing to a leak or virtual leak. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a435-v12-12","title":"超高真空系統：材料、烘烤與放氣預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"The ultrahigh-vacuum system: materials, bake-out and outgassing budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「鈦腔體、CF 法蘭與離子／NEG 幫浦」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Titanium chamber, CF flanges and ion/NEG pumps” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"視窗鍍膜只為 698 nm 最佳化，461 nm 的反射率達 8%，散射的藍光打在腔壁與原子上造成光位移與載入效率下降；更換視窗意味著破真空、重新烘烤並損失數週。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Viewport coatings optimised only for 698 nm reflect 8% at 461 nm, and the scattered blue light hitting walls and atoms causes light shifts and poor loading; replacing the windows means breaking vacuum, rebaking and losing weeks. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：壓力由放氣總量除以有效抽速決定，所以材料面積、烘烤與導管傳導率共同決定最終真空。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Pressure equals total outgassing divided by effective pumping speed, so material area, bake-out and conductance together decide the final vacuum.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「真空只要「夠低」讓原子不被碰掉就好，對鐘的準確度沒有直接影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Vacuum only needs to be low enough to keep atoms from being knocked out and has no direct effect on clock accuracy.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"視窗鍍膜只為 698 nm 最佳化，461 nm 的反射率達 8%，散射的藍光打在腔壁與原子上造成光位移與載入效率下降；更換視窗意味著破真空、重新烘烤並損失數週。","textEn":"Viewport coatings optimised only for 698 nm reflect 8% at 461 nm, and the scattered blue light hitting walls and atoms causes light shifts and poor loading; replacing the windows means breaking vacuum, rebaking and losing weeks.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「超高真空系統：材料、烘烤與放氣預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"The ultrahigh-vacuum system: materials, bake-out and outgassing budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["視窗鍍膜只為 698 nm 最佳化，461 nm 的反射率達 8%，散射的藍光打在腔壁與原子上造成光位移與載入效率下降。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","鐘雷射的線寬只取決於二極體雷射本身的品質。"],"optionsEn":["Viewport coatings optimised only for 698 nm reflect 8% at 461 nm, and the scattered blue light hitting walls and atoms causes light shifts and poor loading.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","The clock laser's linewidth depends only on the quality of the diode laser itself."],"answer":0,"explanation":"視窗鍍膜只為 698 nm 最佳化，461 nm 的反射率達 8%，散射的藍光打在腔壁與原子上造成光位移與載入效率下降；更換視窗意味著破真空、重新烘烤並損失數週。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Viewport coatings optimised only for 698 nm reflect 8% at 461 nm, and the scattered blue light hitting walls and atoms causes light shifts and poor loading; replacing the windows means breaking vacuum, rebaking and losing weeks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a435-v12-13","title":"雷射系統：冷卻雷射、晶格雷射與鐘雷射：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Laser systems: cooling, lattice and clock lasers: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「698 nm 鐘雷射與 ULE 參考腔」如何決定光學原子鐘真空與雷射系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “698 nm clock laser and the ULE reference cavity” determines the key performance of “Optical atomic-clock vacuum and laser systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"鍶鐘需要四種波長：461 nm（由 922 nm 二極體雷射倍頻或直接藍光二極體）、689 nm 窄線寬冷卻光、813 nm 晶格光（鈦藍寶石或錐形放大器，需數百 mW 到 W 級且頻率鎖定）、698 nm 鐘雷射，另加 679 與 707 nm 回泵光。鐘雷射是整個系統的心臟：外腔二極體雷射以龐德—德瑞弗—霍爾（PDH）法鎖到真空中、溫控在零膨脹點的 ULE 玻璃法布里—珀羅腔，腔的高精細度把雷射線寬壓到 Hz 以下，殘餘不穩定度由腔鏡與間隔器的布朗熱雜訊決定。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「698 nm 鐘雷射與 ULE 參考腔」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A strontium clock needs four wavelengths: 461 nm (frequency-doubled 922 nm diode laser or direct blue diode), 689 nm narrow-linewidth cooling light, 813 nm lattice light (titanium-sapphire or tapered amplifier, hundreds of milliwatts to watts and frequency-locked), and the 698 nm clock laser, plus 679 and 707 nm repumpers. The clock laser is the heart of the system: an external-cavity diode laser locked by the Pound–Drever–Hall (PDH) method to a ULE-glass Fabry–Pérot cavity held in vacuum at its zero-expansion temperature; the cavity's high finesse narrows the laser below 1 Hz, and the residual instability is set by Brownian thermal noise of the mirrors and spacer. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “698 nm clock laser and the ULE reference cavity”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：腔長 L = 100 mm、精細度 F = 3×10⁵：自由光譜範圍 c/(2L) = 1.50 GHz，腔線寬 1.50 GHz/3×10⁵ = 5.0 kHz。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a cavity of length L = 100 mm and finesse F = 3×10⁵, the free spectral range is c/(2L) = 1.50 GHz and the cavity linewidth 1.50 GHz/3×10⁵ = 5.0 kHz.","failure":"常見誤解：「鐘雷射的線寬只取決於二極體雷射本身的品質。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The clock laser's linewidth depends only on the quality of the diode laser itself.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「698 nm 鐘雷射與 ULE 參考腔」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “698 nm clock laser and the ULE reference cavity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-13-k1","title":"雷射系統：冷卻雷射、晶格雷射與鐘雷射","titleEn":"Laser systems: cooling, lattice and clock lasers","text":"鍶鐘需要四種波長：461 nm（由 922 nm 二極體雷射倍頻或直接藍光二極體）、689 nm 窄線寬冷卻光、813 nm 晶格光（鈦藍寶石或錐形放大器，需數百 mW 到 W 級且頻率鎖定）、698 nm 鐘雷射，另加 679 與 707 nm 回泵光。鐘雷射是整個系統的心臟：外腔二極體雷射以龐德—德瑞弗—霍爾（PDH）法鎖到真空中、溫控在零膨脹點的 ULE 玻璃法布里—珀羅腔，腔的高精細度把雷射線寬壓到 Hz 以下，殘餘不穩定度由腔鏡與間隔器的布朗熱雜訊決定。","textEn":"A strontium clock needs four wavelengths: 461 nm (frequency-doubled 922 nm diode laser or direct blue diode), 689 nm narrow-linewidth cooling light, 813 nm lattice light (titanium-sapphire or tapered amplifier, hundreds of milliwatts to watts and frequency-locked), and the 698 nm clock laser, plus 679 and 707 nm repumpers. The clock laser is the heart of the system: an external-cavity diode laser locked by the Pound–Drever–Hall (PDH) method to a ULE-glass Fabry–Pérot cavity held in vacuum at its zero-expansion temperature; the cavity's high finesse narrows the laser below 1 Hz, and the residual instability is set by Brownian thermal noise of the mirrors and spacer.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鐘雷射的線寬只取決於二極體雷射本身的品質。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The clock laser's linewidth depends only on the quality of the diode laser itself. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「雷射系統：冷卻雷射、晶格雷射與鐘雷射」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Laser systems: cooling, lattice and clock lasers\" is correct?","options":["鐘雷射的線寬只取決於二極體雷射本身的品質。","鍶鐘需要四種波長：461 nm（由 922 nm 二極體雷射倍頻或直接藍光二極體）、689 nm 窄線寬冷卻光、813 nm 晶格光（鈦藍寶石或錐形放大器，需數百 mW 到 W 級且頻率鎖定）、698 nm 鐘雷射，另加 679 與 707 nm 回泵光。","只要實驗室溫度控制在 ±0.5 °C，黑體輻射位移就可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["The clock laser's linewidth depends only on the quality of the diode laser itself.","A strontium clock needs four wavelengths: 461 nm (frequency-doubled 922 nm diode laser or direct blue diode), 689 nm narrow-linewidth cooling light, 813 nm lattice light (titanium-sapphire or tapered amplifier, hundreds of milliwatts to watts and frequency-locked), and the 698 nm clock laser, plus 679 and 707 nm repumpers.","With the laboratory held to ±0.5 °C, the blackbody-radiation shift can be ignored."],"answer":1,"explanation":"鍶鐘需要四種波長：461 nm（由 922 nm 二極體雷射倍頻或直接藍光二極體）、689 nm 窄線寬冷卻光、813 nm 晶格光（鈦藍寶石或錐形放大器，需數百 mW 到 W 級且頻率鎖定）、698 nm 鐘雷射，另加 679 與 707 nm 回泵光。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A strontium clock needs four wavelengths: 461 nm (frequency-doubled 922 nm diode laser or direct blue diode), 689 nm narrow-linewidth cooling light, 813 nm lattice light (titanium-sapphire or tapered amplifier, hundreds of milliwatts to watts and frequency-locked), and the 698 nm clock laser, plus 679 and 707 nm repumpers. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a435-v12-14","title":"雷射系統：冷卻雷射、晶格雷射與鐘雷射：定量估算","titleEn":"Laser systems: cooling, lattice and clock lasers: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「698 nm 鐘雷射與 ULE 參考腔」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “698 nm clock laser and the ULE reference cavity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：腔長 L = 100 mm、精細度 F = 3×10⁵：自由光譜範圍 c/(2L) = 1.50 GHz，腔線寬 1.50 GHz/3×10⁵ = 5.0 kHz。雷射頻率追隨腔長 Δν/ν = −ΔL/L：腔長變化 1 pm 就使 429 THz 的雷射移動 4.3 kHz；要達到 1×10⁻¹⁶ 的穩定度，腔長必須穩定在 10⁻¹⁶×0.1 m = 10 am（10⁻¹⁷ m），這就是為何腔要放在真空、多層熱屏蔽與主動溫控中，並以熔融石英鏡基板降低熱雜訊。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a cavity of length L = 100 mm and finesse F = 3×10⁵, the free spectral range is c/(2L) = 1.50 GHz and the cavity linewidth 1.50 GHz/3×10⁵ = 5.0 kHz. The laser follows the cavity length through Δν/ν = −ΔL/L: a 1 pm length change moves the 429 THz laser by 4.3 kHz, and a stability of 1×10⁻¹⁶ demands the length be held to 10⁻¹⁶×0.1 m = 10 am (10⁻¹⁷ m), which is why the cavity sits in vacuum behind multiple thermal shields with active temperature control and uses fused-silica mirror substrates to lower thermal noise. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以腔的衰盪（ring-down）時間量精細度：τ_rd = F·L/(πc)，F = 3×10⁵ 時約 32 µs，與 5 kHz 線寬一致；以兩套獨立腔穩頻雷射拍頻，計算艾倫偏差並確認 1–10 s 的平台接近熱雜訊預測；掃描腔溫找出零膨脹點（拍頻對溫度的拋物線頂點），把溫控設定在該點 ±10 mK 內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure finesse by cavity ring-down: τ_rd = F·L/(πc), about 32 µs for F = 3×10⁵, consistent with the 5 kHz linewidth; beat two independently cavity-stabilised lasers, compute the Allan deviation and confirm that the 1–10 s floor approaches the thermal-noise prediction; scan the cavity temperature to find the zero-expansion point (the vertex of the beat-versus-temperature parabola) and set the control within ±10 mK of it.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"腔長 L = 100 mm、精細度 F = 3×10⁵：自由光譜範圍 c/(2L) = 1.50 GHz，腔線寬 1.50 GHz/3×10⁵ = 5.0 kHz。雷射頻率追隨腔長 Δν/ν = −ΔL/L：腔長變化 1 pm 就使 429 THz 的雷射移動 4.3 kHz；要達到 1×10⁻¹⁶ 的穩定度，腔長必須穩定在 10⁻¹⁶×0.1 m = 10 am（10⁻¹⁷ m），這就是為何腔要放在真空、多層熱屏蔽與主動溫控中，並以熔融石英鏡基板降低熱雜訊。","textEn":"For a cavity of length L = 100 mm and finesse F = 3×10⁵, the free spectral range is c/(2L) = 1.50 GHz and the cavity linewidth 1.50 GHz/3×10⁵ = 5.0 kHz. The laser follows the cavity length through Δν/ν = −ΔL/L: a 1 pm length change moves the 429 THz laser by 4.3 kHz, and a stability of 1×10⁻¹⁶ demands the length be held to 10⁻¹⁶×0.1 m = 10 am (10⁻¹⁷ m), which is why the cavity sits in vacuum behind multiple thermal shields with active temperature control and uses fused-silica mirror substrates to lower thermal noise.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「雷射系統：冷卻雷射、晶格雷射與鐘雷射」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Laser systems: cooling, lattice and clock lasers\", which statement holds?","options":["單模光纖只是把光從 A 點送到 B 點，不會改變光的頻率。","光鐘比銫鐘準是因為雷射比微波源更穩定。","腔長 L = 100 mm、精細度 F = 3×10⁵：自由光譜範圍 c/(2L) = 1.50 GHz，腔線寬 1.50 GHz/3×10⁵ = 5.0 kHz。"],"optionsEn":["A single-mode fibre merely moves light from A to B and cannot change its frequency.","Optical clocks beat caesium clocks because lasers are more stable than microwave sources.","For a cavity of length L = 100 mm and finesse F = 3×10⁵, the free spectral range is c/(2L) = 1.50 GHz and the cavity linewidth 1.50 GHz/3×10⁵ = 5.0 kHz."],"answer":2,"explanation":"腔長 L = 100 mm、精細度 F = 3×10⁵：自由光譜範圍 c/(2L) = 1.50 GHz，腔線寬 1.50 GHz/3×10⁵ = 5.0 kHz。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a cavity of length L = 100 mm and finesse F = 3×10⁵, the free spectral range is c/(2L) = 1.50 GHz and the cavity linewidth 1.50 GHz/3×10⁵ = 5.0 kHz. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a435-v12-15","title":"雷射系統：冷卻雷射、晶格雷射與鐘雷射：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Laser systems: cooling, lattice and clock lasers: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「698 nm 鐘雷射與 ULE 參考腔」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “698 nm clock laser and the ULE reference cavity” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以腔的衰盪（ring-down）時間量精細度：τ_rd = F·L/(πc)，F = 3×10⁵ 時約 32 µs，與 5 kHz 線寬一致；以兩套獨立腔穩頻雷射拍頻，計算艾倫偏差並確認 1–10 s 的平台接近熱雜訊預測；掃描腔溫找出零膨脹點（拍頻對溫度的拋物線頂點），把溫控設定在該點 ±10 mK 內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure finesse by cavity ring-down: τ_rd = F·L/(πc), about 32 µs for F = 3×10⁵, consistent with the 5 kHz linewidth; beat two independently cavity-stabilised lasers, compute the Allan deviation and confirm that the 1–10 s floor approaches the thermal-noise prediction; scan the cavity temperature to find the zero-expansion point (the vertex of the beat-versus-temperature parabola) and set the control within ±10 mK of it. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：ULE 腔的溫度設在零膨脹點以外 1 K，二次膨脹係數使腔長對溫度的斜率約 2×10⁻⁹/K，溫控的 1 mK 起伏就造成 2×10⁻¹² 的頻率漂移——比鐘的目標差六個數量級，鐘伺服永遠在追雷射。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Operating the ULE cavity 1 K away from its zero-expansion point gives a length slope of about 2×10⁻⁹/K from the quadratic expansion coefficient, so 1 mK of temperature ripple produces 2×10⁻¹² frequency drift, six orders worse than the clock's goal, and the clock servo is forever chasing the laser.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以腔的衰盪（ring-down）時間量精細度：τ_rd = F·L/(πc)，F = 3×10⁵ 時約 32 µs，與 5 kHz 線寬一致；以兩套獨立腔穩頻雷射拍頻，計算艾倫偏差並確認 1–10 s 的平台接近熱雜訊預測；掃描腔溫找出零膨脹點（拍頻對溫度的拋物線頂點），把溫控設定在該點 ±10 mK 內。","textEn":"Measure finesse by cavity ring-down: τ_rd = F·L/(πc), about 32 µs for F = 3×10⁵, consistent with the 5 kHz linewidth; beat two independently cavity-stabilised lasers, compute the Allan deviation and confirm that the 1–10 s floor approaches the thermal-noise prediction; scan the cavity temperature to find the zero-expansion point (the vertex of the beat-versus-temperature parabola) and set the control within ±10 mK of it.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「雷射系統：冷卻雷射、晶格雷射與鐘雷射」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Laser systems: cooling, lattice and clock lasers\"?","options":["以腔的衰盪（ring-down）時間量精細度：τ_rd = F·L/(πc)，F = 3×10⁵ 時約 32 µs，與 5 kHz 線寬一致。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要原子夠冷，不用晶格也能用秒級探測得到 Hz 級線寬。"],"optionsEn":["Measure finesse by cavity ring-down: τ_rd = F·L/(πc), about 32 µs for F = 3×10⁵, consistent with the 5 kHz linewidth.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Cold enough atoms give hertz-level linewidths with second-long probes even without a lattice."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以腔的衰盪（ring-down）時間量精細度：τ_rd = F·L/(πc)，F = 3×10⁵ 時約 32 µs，與 5 kHz 線寬一致；以兩套獨立腔穩頻雷射拍頻，計算艾倫偏差並確認 1–10 s 的平台接近熱雜訊預測；掃描腔溫找出零膨脹點（拍頻對溫度的拋物線頂點），把溫控設定在該點 ±10 mK 內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure finesse by cavity ring-down: τ_rd = F·L/(πc), about 32 µs for F = 3×10⁵, consistent with the 5 kHz linewidth; beat two independently cavity-stabilised lasers, compute the Allan deviation and confirm that the 1–10 s floor approaches the thermal-noise prediction; scan the cavity temperature to find the zero-expansion point (the vertex of the beat-versus-temperature parabola) and set the control within ±10 mK of it. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a435-v12-16","title":"雷射系統：冷卻雷射、晶格雷射與鐘雷射：失效診斷","titleEn":"Laser systems: cooling, lattice and clock lasers: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「698 nm 鐘雷射與 ULE 參考腔」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “698 nm clock laser and the ULE reference cavity” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"ULE 腔的溫度設在零膨脹點以外 1 K，二次膨脹係數使腔長對溫度的斜率約 2×10⁻⁹/K，溫控的 1 mK 起伏就造成 2×10⁻¹² 的頻率漂移——比鐘的目標差六個數量級，鐘伺服永遠在追雷射。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Operating the ULE cavity 1 K away from its zero-expansion point gives a length slope of about 2×10⁻⁹/K from the quadratic expansion coefficient, so 1 mK of temperature ripple produces 2×10⁻¹² frequency drift, six orders worse than the clock's goal, and the clock servo is forever chasing the laser. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：鐘雷射是整個系統的心臟：外腔二極體雷射以龐德—德瑞弗—霍爾（PDH）法鎖到真空中、溫控在零膨脹點的 ULE 玻璃法布里—珀羅腔，腔的高精細度把雷射線寬壓到 Hz 以下，殘餘不穩定度由腔鏡與間隔器的布朗熱雜訊決定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The clock laser is the heart of the system: an external-cavity diode laser locked by the Pound–Drever–Hall (PDH) method to a ULE-glass Fabry–Pérot cavity held in vacuum at its zero-expansion temperature; the cavity's high finesse narrows the laser below 1 Hz, and the residual instability is set by Brownian thermal noise of the mirrors and spacer.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鐘雷射的線寬只取決於二極體雷射本身的品質。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The clock laser's linewidth depends only on the quality of the diode laser itself.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"ULE 腔的溫度設在零膨脹點以外 1 K，二次膨脹係數使腔長對溫度的斜率約 2×10⁻⁹/K，溫控的 1 mK 起伏就造成 2×10⁻¹² 的頻率漂移——比鐘的目標差六個數量級，鐘伺服永遠在追雷射。","textEn":"Operating the ULE cavity 1 K away from its zero-expansion point gives a length slope of about 2×10⁻⁹/K from the quadratic expansion coefficient, so 1 mK of temperature ripple produces 2×10⁻¹² frequency drift, six orders worse than the clock's goal, and the clock servo is forever chasing the laser.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「雷射系統：冷卻雷射、晶格雷射與鐘雷射」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Laser systems: cooling, lattice and clock lasers\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","ULE 腔的溫度設在零膨脹點以外 1 K，二次膨脹係數使腔長對溫度的斜率約 2×10⁻⁹/K，溫控的 1 mK 起伏就造成 2×10⁻¹² 的頻率漂移——比鐘的目標差六個數量級，鐘伺服永遠在追雷射。","只要實驗室溫度控制在 ±0.5 °C，黑體輻射位移就可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Operating the ULE cavity 1 K away from its zero-expansion point gives a length slope of about 2×10⁻⁹/K from the quadratic expansion coefficient, so 1 mK of temperature ripple produces 2×10⁻¹² frequency drift, six orders worse than the clock's goal, and the clock servo is forever chasing the laser.","With the laboratory held to ±0.5 °C, the blackbody-radiation shift can be ignored."],"answer":1,"explanation":"ULE 腔的溫度設在零膨脹點以外 1 K，二次膨脹係數使腔長對溫度的斜率約 2×10⁻⁹/K，溫控的 1 mK 起伏就造成 2×10⁻¹² 的頻率漂移——比鐘的目標差六個數量級，鐘伺服永遠在追雷射。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Operating the ULE cavity 1 K away from its zero-expansion point gives a length slope of about 2×10⁻⁹/K from the quadratic expansion coefficient, so 1 mK of temperature ripple produces 2×10⁻¹² frequency drift, six orders worse than the clock's goal, and the clock servo is forever chasing the laser. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a435-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「系統頻率位移的量測與修正」與「不確定度預算與穩定度瓶頸」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Measuring and correcting systematic frequency shifts\" and \"Uncertainty budget and stability bottlenecks\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a435-v12-17","title":"系統頻率位移的量測與修正：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Measuring and correcting systematic frequency shifts: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「黑體輻射位移與腔體溫度」如何決定光學原子鐘真空與雷射系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Blackbody-radiation shift and chamber temperature” determines the key performance of “Optical atomic-clock vacuum and laser systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"光鐘的準確度由一張系統位移表決定，每一項都要被量測、修正並給出不確定度。黑體輻射位移來自室溫環境輻射對鐘能階的交流史塔克位移，與溫度的四次方成正比，是鍶鐘最大的一項；晶格光位移以在不同晶格深度下量鐘頻率外推到零深度來評估；密度位移以改變原子數外推；二階季曼位移以量兩個對稱的塞曼分量間距得到磁場並計算；背景氣體碰撞位移與探測光位移則分別由壓力與探測功率的相依性評估。這些量測都用「交錯」方式進行：兩組條件逐週期交替，以消除雷射漂移。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「黑體輻射位移與腔體溫度」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An optical clock's accuracy is set by a table of systematic shifts, each measured, corrected and assigned an uncertainty. The blackbody-radiation shift is the AC Stark shift of the clock levels by room-temperature thermal radiation, scales with the fourth power of temperature and is the largest item for strontium; the lattice light shift is evaluated by measuring the clock frequency at several lattice depths and extrapolating to zero; the density shift by varying atom number; the second-order Zeeman shift by measuring the splitting of two symmetric Zeeman components to obtain the field and computing the shift; background-gas and probe-light shifts from their dependence on pressure and probe power. All are measured in interleaved fashion, alternating two conditions cycle by cycle to cancel laser drift. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Blackbody-radiation shift and chamber temperature”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：⁸⁷Sr 在 300 K 的黑體輻射位移約 −5×10⁻¹⁵（相對值），按 T⁴ 變化，故 δ(Δν)/Δν = 4·δT/T。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The ⁸⁷Sr blackbody shift at 300 K is about −5×10⁻¹⁵ fractionally and scales as T⁴, so δ(Δν)/Δν = 4·δT/T.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要實驗室溫度控制在 ±0.5 °C，黑體輻射位移就可以忽略。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With the laboratory held to ±0.5 °C, the blackbody-radiation shift can be ignored.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「黑體輻射位移與腔體溫度」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Blackbody-radiation shift and chamber temperature”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-17-k1","title":"系統頻率位移的量測與修正","titleEn":"Measuring and correcting systematic frequency shifts","text":"光鐘的準確度由一張系統位移表決定，每一項都要被量測、修正並給出不確定度。黑體輻射位移來自室溫環境輻射對鐘能階的交流史塔克位移，與溫度的四次方成正比，是鍶鐘最大的一項；晶格光位移以在不同晶格深度下量鐘頻率外推到零深度來評估；密度位移以改變原子數外推；二階季曼位移以量兩個對稱的塞曼分量間距得到磁場並計算；背景氣體碰撞位移與探測光位移則分別由壓力與探測功率的相依性評估。","textEn":"An optical clock's accuracy is set by a table of systematic shifts, each measured, corrected and assigned an uncertainty. The blackbody-radiation shift is the AC Stark shift of the clock levels by room-temperature thermal radiation, scales with the fourth power of temperature and is the largest item for strontium; the lattice light shift is evaluated by measuring the clock frequency at several lattice depths and extrapolating to zero; the density shift by varying atom number; the second-order Zeeman shift by measuring the splitting of two symmetric Zeeman components to obtain the field and computing the shift; background-gas and probe-light shifts from their dependence on pressure and probe power.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要實驗室溫度控制在 ±0.5 °C，黑體輻射位移就可以忽略。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With the laboratory held to ±0.5 °C, the blackbody-radiation shift can be ignored. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「系統頻率位移的量測與修正」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Measuring and correcting systematic frequency shifts\" is correct?","options":["只要實驗室溫度控制在 ±0.5 °C，黑體輻射位移就可以忽略。","準確度與穩定度是同一件事，艾倫偏差小就代表鐘準。","光鐘的準確度由一張系統位移表決定，每一項都要被量測、修正並給出不確定度。"],"optionsEn":["With the laboratory held to ±0.5 °C, the blackbody-radiation shift can be ignored.","Accuracy and stability are the same thing, so a small Allan deviation means the clock is accurate.","An optical clock's accuracy is set by a table of systematic shifts, each measured, corrected and assigned an uncertainty."],"answer":2,"explanation":"光鐘的準確度由一張系統位移表決定，每一項都要被量測、修正並給出不確定度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An optical clock's accuracy is set by a table of systematic shifts, each measured, corrected and assigned an uncertainty. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a435-v12-18","title":"系統頻率位移的量測與修正：定量估算","titleEn":"Measuring and correcting systematic frequency shifts: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「黑體輻射位移與腔體溫度」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Blackbody-radiation shift and chamber temperature” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：⁸⁷Sr 在 300 K 的黑體輻射位移約 −5×10⁻¹⁵（相對值），按 T⁴ 變化，故 δ(Δν)/Δν = 4·δT/T。若要把此項不確定度壓到 5×10⁻¹⁹，需 δT/T = (5×10⁻¹⁹/5×10⁻¹⁵)/4 = 2.5×10⁻⁵，即 δT = 300 K×2.5×10⁻⁵ = 7.5 mK：腔體溫度必須以校正過的鉑電阻溫度計在多點量到 10 mK 以內，且原子看到的有效溫度要考慮視窗與加熱元件的輻射。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The ⁸⁷Sr blackbody shift at 300 K is about −5×10⁻¹⁵ fractionally and scales as T⁴, so δ(Δν)/Δν = 4·δT/T. To hold this item's uncertainty to 5×10⁻¹⁹ requires δT/T = (5×10⁻¹⁹/5×10⁻¹⁵)/4 = 2.5×10⁻⁵, i.e. δT = 300 K×2.5×10⁻⁵ = 7.5 mK: the chamber temperature must be measured at several points with calibrated platinum thermometers to within 10 mK, and the effective temperature seen by the atoms must account for radiation from windows and heated elements. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在腔體外壁與視窗座安裝至少 6 支校正鉑電阻，記錄 24 小時溫度分佈並以有限元素模型推算原子位置的有效輻射溫度；以交錯量測在晶格深度 50、100、200 E_r 下取鐘頻率，線性外推到零深度得到晶格光位移與其斜率；原子數減半重做，得到密度位移係數。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Mount at least six calibrated platinum thermometers on the chamber walls and viewport mounts, log the 24 hour temperature distribution and compute the effective radiation temperature at the atoms with a finite-element model; take interleaved clock frequencies at lattice depths of 50, 100 and 200 E_r and extrapolate linearly to zero to obtain the lattice light shift and its slope; repeat with half the atom number to obtain the density-shift coefficient.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"⁸⁷Sr 在 300 K 的黑體輻射位移約 −5×10⁻¹⁵（相對值），按 T⁴ 變化，故 δ(Δν)/Δν = 4·δT/T。若要把此項不確定度壓到 5×10⁻¹⁹，需 δT/T = (5×10⁻¹⁹/5×10⁻¹⁵)/4 = 2.5×10⁻⁵，即 δT = 300 K×2.5×10⁻⁵ = 7.5 mK：腔體溫度必須以校正過的鉑電阻溫度計在多點量到 10 mK 以內，且原子看到的有效溫度要考慮視窗與加熱元件的輻射。","textEn":"The ⁸⁷Sr blackbody shift at 300 K is about −5×10⁻¹⁵ fractionally and scales as T⁴, so δ(Δν)/Δν = 4·δT/T. To hold this item's uncertainty to 5×10⁻¹⁹ requires δT/T = (5×10⁻¹⁹/5×10⁻¹⁵)/4 = 2.5×10⁻⁵, i.e. δT = 300 K×2.5×10⁻⁵ = 7.5 mK: the chamber temperature must be measured at several points with calibrated platinum thermometers to within 10 mK, and the effective temperature seen by the atoms must account for radiation from windows and heated elements.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「系統頻率位移的量測與修正」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Measuring and correcting systematic frequency shifts\", which statement holds?","options":["⁸⁷Sr 在 300 K 的黑體輻射位移約 −5×10⁻¹⁵（相對值），按 T⁴ 變化，故 δ(Δν)/Δν = 4·δT/T。","一台鐘的系統不確定度表做完一次，就能永久代表它的準確度。","只要原子夠冷，不用晶格也能用秒級探測得到 Hz 級線寬。"],"optionsEn":["The ⁸⁷Sr blackbody shift at 300 K is about −5×10⁻¹⁵ fractionally and scales as T⁴, so δ(Δν)/Δν = 4·δT/T.","Once a clock's systematic table is completed, it represents the clock's accuracy permanently.","Cold enough atoms give hertz-level linewidths with second-long probes even without a lattice."],"answer":0,"explanation":"⁸⁷Sr 在 300 K 的黑體輻射位移約 −5×10⁻¹⁵（相對值），按 T⁴ 變化，故 δ(Δν)/Δν = 4·δT/T。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The ⁸⁷Sr blackbody shift at 300 K is about −5×10⁻¹⁵ fractionally and scales as T⁴, so δ(Δν)/Δν = 4·δT/T. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a435-v12-19","title":"系統頻率位移的量測與修正：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Measuring and correcting systematic frequency shifts: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「黑體輻射位移與腔體溫度」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Blackbody-radiation shift and chamber temperature” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在腔體外壁與視窗座安裝至少 6 支校正鉑電阻，記錄 24 小時溫度分佈並以有限元素模型推算原子位置的有效輻射溫度；以交錯量測在晶格深度 50、100、200 E_r 下取鐘頻率，線性外推到零深度得到晶格光位移與其斜率；原子數減半重做，得到密度位移係數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Mount at least six calibrated platinum thermometers on the chamber walls and viewport mounts, log the 24 hour temperature distribution and compute the effective radiation temperature at the atoms with a finite-element model; take interleaved clock frequencies at lattice depths of 50, 100 and 200 E_r and extrapolate linearly to zero to obtain the lattice light shift and its slope; repeat with half the atom number to obtain the density-shift coefficient. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：鐘雷射的回泵或冷卻光的雜散光經由視窗進入晶格區，造成未被列入位移表的額外光位移，鐘與另一台鐘比對時出現 3×10⁻¹⁷ 的無法解釋偏差，追查數月才發現是一片未關閉的機械快門。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Stray repumper or cooling light leaking through a viewport into the lattice region causes an extra light shift absent from the table, the clock shows an unexplained 3×10⁻¹⁷ offset against another clock, and months of searching end at a mechanical shutter that never fully closed.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在腔體外壁與視窗座安裝至少 6 支校正鉑電阻，記錄 24 小時溫度分佈並以有限元素模型推算原子位置的有效輻射溫度；以交錯量測在晶格深度 50、100、200 E_r 下取鐘頻率，線性外推到零深度得到晶格光位移與其斜率；原子數減半重做，得到密度位移係數。","textEn":"Mount at least six calibrated platinum thermometers on the chamber walls and viewport mounts, log the 24 hour temperature distribution and compute the effective radiation temperature at the atoms with a finite-element model; take interleaved clock frequencies at lattice depths of 50, 100 and 200 E_r and extrapolate linearly to zero to obtain the lattice light shift and its slope; repeat with half the atom number to obtain the density-shift coefficient.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「系統頻率位移的量測與修正」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Measuring and correcting systematic frequency shifts\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","在腔體外壁與視窗座安裝至少 6 支校正鉑電阻，記錄 24 小時溫度分佈並以有限元素模型推算原子位置的有效輻射溫度。","真空只要「夠低」讓原子不被碰掉就好，對鐘的準確度沒有直接影響。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Mount at least six calibrated platinum thermometers on the chamber walls and viewport mounts, log the 24 hour temperature distribution and compute the effective radiation temperature at the atoms with a finite-element model.","Vacuum only needs to be low enough to keep atoms from being knocked out and has no direct effect on clock accuracy."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在腔體外壁與視窗座安裝至少 6 支校正鉑電阻，記錄 24 小時溫度分佈並以有限元素模型推算原子位置的有效輻射溫度；以交錯量測在晶格深度 50、100、200 E_r 下取鐘頻率，線性外推到零深度得到晶格光位移與其斜率；原子數減半重做，得到密度位移係數。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Mount at least six calibrated platinum thermometers on the chamber walls and viewport mounts, log the 24 hour temperature distribution and compute the effective radiation temperature at the atoms with a finite-element model; take interleaved clock frequencies at lattice depths of 50, 100 and 200 E_r and extrapolate linearly to zero to obtain the lattice light shift and its slope; repeat with half the atom number to obtain the density-shift coefficient. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a435-v12-20","title":"系統頻率位移的量測與修正：失效診斷","titleEn":"Measuring and correcting systematic frequency shifts: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「黑體輻射位移與腔體溫度」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Blackbody-radiation shift and chamber temperature” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"鐘雷射的回泵或冷卻光的雜散光經由視窗進入晶格區，造成未被列入位移表的額外光位移，鐘與另一台鐘比對時出現 3×10⁻¹⁷ 的無法解釋偏差，追查數月才發現是一片未關閉的機械快門。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Stray repumper or cooling light leaking through a viewport into the lattice region causes an extra light shift absent from the table, the clock shows an unexplained 3×10⁻¹⁷ offset against another clock, and months of searching end at a mechanical shutter that never fully closed. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：這些量測都用「交錯」方式進行：兩組條件逐週期交替，以消除雷射漂移。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: All are measured in interleaved fashion, alternating two conditions cycle by cycle to cancel laser drift.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要實驗室溫度控制在 ±0.5 °C，黑體輻射位移就可以忽略。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With the laboratory held to ±0.5 °C, the blackbody-radiation shift can be ignored.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"鐘雷射的回泵或冷卻光的雜散光經由視窗進入晶格區，造成未被列入位移表的額外光位移，鐘與另一台鐘比對時出現 3×10⁻¹⁷ 的無法解釋偏差，追查數月才發現是一片未關閉的機械快門。","textEn":"Stray repumper or cooling light leaking through a viewport into the lattice region causes an extra light shift absent from the table, the clock shows an unexplained 3×10⁻¹⁷ offset against another clock, and months of searching end at a mechanical shutter that never fully closed.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「系統頻率位移的量測與修正」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Measuring and correcting systematic frequency shifts\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","準確度與穩定度是同一件事，艾倫偏差小就代表鐘準。","鐘雷射的回泵或冷卻光的雜散光經由視窗進入晶格區，造成未被列入位移表的額外光位移，鐘與另一台鐘比對時出現 3×10⁻¹⁷ 的無法解釋偏差，追查數月才發現是一片未關閉的機械快門。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Accuracy and stability are the same thing, so a small Allan deviation means the clock is accurate.","Stray repumper or cooling light leaking through a viewport into the lattice region causes an extra light shift absent from the table, the clock shows an unexplained 3×10⁻¹⁷ offset against another clock, and months of searching end at a mechanical shutter that never fully closed."],"answer":2,"explanation":"鐘雷射的回泵或冷卻光的雜散光經由視窗進入晶格區，造成未被列入位移表的額外光位移，鐘與另一台鐘比對時出現 3×10⁻¹⁷ 的無法解釋偏差，追查數月才發現是一片未關閉的機械快門。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Stray repumper or cooling light leaking through a viewport into the lattice region causes an extra light shift absent from the table, the clock shows an unexplained 3×10⁻¹⁷ offset against another clock, and months of searching end at a mechanical shutter that never fully closed. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a435-v12-21","title":"不確定度預算與穩定度瓶頸：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Uncertainty budget and stability bottlenecks: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「系統不確定度表與迪克效應」如何決定光學原子鐘真空與雷射系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Systematic-uncertainty table and the Dick effect” determines the key performance of “Optical atomic-clock vacuum and laser systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"準確度預算把各項位移的不確定度以均方根合成，目標是 10⁻¹⁸ 等級；穩定度預算則找出到達該準確度所需的平均時間。迪克效應是穩定度的主要瓶頸：鐘週期中只有探測時段對雷射頻率取樣，裝載與冷卻的死時間讓雷射在探測頻率諧波處的雜訊被降頻混疊進誤差訊號，使穩定度比量子投影雜訊極限差一個數量級；對策是縮短死時間、改善鐘雷射，或以兩套原子系統交錯探測（零死時間）。預算表的另一個用途是指出哪一項值得投入：黑體輻射與晶格位移通常並列最大。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「系統不確定度表與迪克效應」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The accuracy budget combines the uncertainties of all shifts root-sum-square with a target at the 10⁻¹⁸ level; the stability budget finds the averaging time needed to reach that accuracy. The Dick effect is the main stability bottleneck: only the probe interval of each cycle samples the laser frequency, and the dead time for loading and cooling aliases laser noise at harmonics of the cycle frequency into the error signal, making stability an order worse than the quantum-projection limit; remedies are shorter dead time, a better clock laser, or two atomic systems probed in interleaved fashion (zero dead time). The table also shows where effort pays off: blackbody and lattice shifts are usually tied for largest. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Systematic-uncertainty table and the Dick effect”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：預算（相對值，k = 1，教學假設）：黑體輻射 5×10⁻¹⁹、晶格光位移 6×10⁻¹⁹、密度位移 3×10⁻¹⁹、二階季曼 2×10⁻¹⁹、背景氣體 3×10⁻¹⁹、伺服誤差 2×10⁻¹⁹。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Budget (fractional, k = 1, teaching assumptions): blackbody 5×10⁻¹⁹, lattice light shift 6×10⁻¹⁹, density 3×10⁻¹⁹, second-order Zeeman 2×10⁻¹⁹, background gas 3×10⁻¹⁹, servo error 2×10⁻¹⁹.","failure":"常見誤解：「準確度與穩定度是同一件事，艾倫偏差小就代表鐘準。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Accuracy and stability are the same thing, so a small Allan deviation means the clock is accurate.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「系統不確定度表與迪克效應」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Systematic-uncertainty table and the Dick effect”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-21-k1","title":"不確定度預算與穩定度瓶頸","titleEn":"Uncertainty budget and stability bottlenecks","text":"準確度預算把各項位移的不確定度以均方根合成，目標是 10⁻¹⁸ 等級；穩定度預算則找出到達該準確度所需的平均時間。迪克效應是穩定度的主要瓶頸：鐘週期中只有探測時段對雷射頻率取樣，裝載與冷卻的死時間讓雷射在探測頻率諧波處的雜訊被降頻混疊進誤差訊號，使穩定度比量子投影雜訊極限差一個數量級；對策是縮短死時間、改善鐘雷射，或以兩套原子系統交錯探測（零死時間）。","textEn":"The accuracy budget combines the uncertainties of all shifts root-sum-square with a target at the 10⁻¹⁸ level; the stability budget finds the averaging time needed to reach that accuracy. The Dick effect is the main stability bottleneck: only the probe interval of each cycle samples the laser frequency, and the dead time for loading and cooling aliases laser noise at harmonics of the cycle frequency into the error signal, making stability an order worse than the quantum-projection limit; remedies are shorter dead time, a better clock laser, or two atomic systems probed in interleaved fashion (zero dead time).","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：準確度與穩定度是同一件事，艾倫偏差小就代表鐘準。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Accuracy and stability are the same thing, so a small Allan deviation means the clock is accurate. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「不確定度預算與穩定度瓶頸」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Uncertainty budget and stability bottlenecks\" is correct?","options":["準確度預算把各項位移的不確定度以均方根合成，目標是 10⁻¹⁸ 等級；穩定度預算則找出到達該準確度所需的平均時間。","準確度與穩定度是同一件事，艾倫偏差小就代表鐘準。","單模光纖只是把光從 A 點送到 B 點，不會改變光的頻率。"],"optionsEn":["The accuracy budget combines the uncertainties of all shifts root-sum-square with a target at the 10⁻¹⁸ level.","Accuracy and stability are the same thing, so a small Allan deviation means the clock is accurate.","A single-mode fibre merely moves light from A to B and cannot change its frequency."],"answer":0,"explanation":"準確度預算把各項位移的不確定度以均方根合成，目標是 10⁻¹⁸ 等級；穩定度預算則找出到達該準確度所需的平均時間。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The accuracy budget combines the uncertainties of all shifts root-sum-square with a target at the 10⁻¹⁸ level; the stability budget finds the averaging time needed to reach that accuracy. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a435-v12-22","title":"不確定度預算與穩定度瓶頸：定量估算","titleEn":"Uncertainty budget and stability bottlenecks: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「系統不確定度表與迪克效應」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Systematic-uncertainty table and the Dick effect” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：預算（相對值，k = 1，教學假設）：黑體輻射 5×10⁻¹⁹、晶格光位移 6×10⁻¹⁹、密度位移 3×10⁻¹⁹、二階季曼 2×10⁻¹⁹、背景氣體 3×10⁻¹⁹、伺服誤差 2×10⁻¹⁹。合成 = √(25 + 36 + 9 + 4 + 9 + 4)×10⁻¹⁹ = √87×10⁻¹⁹ = 9.3×10⁻¹⁹。若晶格光位移改善到 3×10⁻¹⁹，總值降到 7.5×10⁻¹⁹；但若黑體項惡化到 2×10⁻¹⁸（溫度只量到 30 mK），總值跳到 2.2×10⁻¹⁸，其他項的努力全被淹沒。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Budget (fractional, k = 1, teaching assumptions): blackbody 5×10⁻¹⁹, lattice light shift 6×10⁻¹⁹, density 3×10⁻¹⁹, second-order Zeeman 2×10⁻¹⁹, background gas 3×10⁻¹⁹, servo error 2×10⁻¹⁹. Combined = √(25 + 36 + 9 + 4 + 9 + 4)×10⁻¹⁹ = √87×10⁻¹⁹ = 9.3×10⁻¹⁹. Improving the lattice shift to 3×10⁻¹⁹ lowers the total to 7.5×10⁻¹⁹; but letting the blackbody term degrade to 2×10⁻¹⁸ (temperature known only to 30 mK) jumps the total to 2.2×10⁻¹⁸ and drowns every other effort. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把鐘週期的死時間從 0.7 s 縮到 0.3 s 並量艾倫偏差，確認 1 s 穩定度依迪克效應模型改善；以鐘雷射的量測相位雜訊譜代入迪克公式計算預期的穩定度，與量測值比較在 30% 內；每季重新評估預算表中最大的兩項並記錄變化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Shorten the dead time from 0.7 s to 0.3 s and remeasure the Allan deviation, confirming that the 1 s stability improves as the Dick-effect model predicts; feed the measured clock-laser phase-noise spectrum into the Dick formula and compare the predicted stability with measurement within 30%; re-evaluate the two largest table items every quarter and log the changes.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"預算（相對值，k = 1，教學假設）：黑體輻射 5×10⁻¹⁹、晶格光位移 6×10⁻¹⁹、密度位移 3×10⁻¹⁹、二階季曼 2×10⁻¹⁹、背景氣體 3×10⁻¹⁹、伺服誤差 2×10⁻¹⁹。合成 = √(25 + 36 + 9 + 4 + 9 + 4)×10⁻¹⁹ = √87×10⁻¹⁹ = 9.3×10⁻¹⁹。若晶格光位移改善到 3×10⁻¹⁹，總值降到 7.5×10⁻¹⁹；但若黑體項惡化到 2×10⁻¹⁸（溫度只量到 30 mK），總值跳到 2.2×10⁻¹⁸，其他項的努力全被淹沒。","textEn":"Budget (fractional, k = 1, teaching assumptions): blackbody 5×10⁻¹⁹, lattice light shift 6×10⁻¹⁹, density 3×10⁻¹⁹, second-order Zeeman 2×10⁻¹⁹, background gas 3×10⁻¹⁹, servo error 2×10⁻¹⁹. Combined = √(25 + 36 + 9 + 4 + 9 + 4)×10⁻¹⁹ = √87×10⁻¹⁹ = 9.3×10⁻¹⁹. Improving the lattice shift to 3×10⁻¹⁹ lowers the total to 7.5×10⁻¹⁹; but letting the blackbody term degrade to 2×10⁻¹⁸ (temperature known only to 30 mK) jumps the total to 2.2×10⁻¹⁸ and drowns every other effort.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「不確定度預算與穩定度瓶頸」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Uncertainty budget and stability bottlenecks\", which statement holds?","options":["光鐘比銫鐘準是因為雷射比微波源更穩定。","預算（相對值，k = 1，教學假設）：黑體輻射 5×10⁻¹⁹、晶格光位移 6×10⁻¹⁹、密度位移 3×10⁻¹⁹、二階季曼 2×10⁻¹⁹、背景氣體 3×10⁻¹⁹、伺服誤差 2×10⁻¹⁹。","真空只要「夠低」讓原子不被碰掉就好，對鐘的準確度沒有直接影響。"],"optionsEn":["Optical clocks beat caesium clocks because lasers are more stable than microwave sources.","Budget (fractional, k = 1, teaching assumptions): blackbody 5×10⁻¹⁹, lattice light shift 6×10⁻¹⁹, density 3×10⁻¹⁹, second-order Zeeman 2×10⁻¹⁹, background gas 3×10⁻¹⁹, servo error 2×10⁻¹⁹.","Vacuum only needs to be low enough to keep atoms from being knocked out and has no direct effect on clock accuracy."],"answer":1,"explanation":"預算（相對值，k = 1，教學假設）：黑體輻射 5×10⁻¹⁹、晶格光位移 6×10⁻¹⁹、密度位移 3×10⁻¹⁹、二階季曼 2×10⁻¹⁹、背景氣體 3×10⁻¹⁹、伺服誤差 2×10⁻¹⁹。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Budget (fractional, k = 1, teaching assumptions): blackbody 5×10⁻¹⁹, lattice light shift 6×10⁻¹⁹, density 3×10⁻¹⁹, second-order Zeeman 2×10⁻¹⁹, background gas 3×10⁻¹⁹, servo error 2×10⁻¹⁹. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a435-v12-23","title":"不確定度預算與穩定度瓶頸：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Uncertainty budget and stability bottlenecks: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「系統不確定度表與迪克效應」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Systematic-uncertainty table and the Dick effect” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把鐘週期的死時間從 0.7 s 縮到 0.3 s 並量艾倫偏差，確認 1 s 穩定度依迪克效應模型改善；以鐘雷射的量測相位雜訊譜代入迪克公式計算預期的穩定度，與量測值比較在 30% 內；每季重新評估預算表中最大的兩項並記錄變化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Shorten the dead time from 0.7 s to 0.3 s and remeasure the Allan deviation, confirming that the 1 s stability improves as the Dick-effect model predicts; feed the measured clock-laser phase-noise spectrum into the Dick formula and compare the predicted stability with measurement within 30%; re-evaluate the two largest table items every quarter and log the changes. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：穩定度長期停在 5×10⁻¹⁶/√τ，團隊花一年改善原子數與晶格，卻沒有量鐘雷射的相位雜訊譜；最後發現腔的隔振平台失效，迪克效應放大了 1–10 Hz 的地面振動。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Stability sits at 5×10⁻¹⁶/√τ for a year while the team improves atom number and lattice without measuring the clock laser's phase-noise spectrum; the cause turns out to be a failed vibration-isolation platform under the cavity, whose 1–10 Hz ground motion the Dick effect amplifies.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把鐘週期的死時間從 0.7 s 縮到 0.3 s 並量艾倫偏差，確認 1 s 穩定度依迪克效應模型改善；以鐘雷射的量測相位雜訊譜代入迪克公式計算預期的穩定度，與量測值比較在 30% 內；每季重新評估預算表中最大的兩項並記錄變化。","textEn":"Shorten the dead time from 0.7 s to 0.3 s and remeasure the Allan deviation, confirming that the 1 s stability improves as the Dick-effect model predicts; feed the measured clock-laser phase-noise spectrum into the Dick formula and compare the predicted stability with measurement within 30%; re-evaluate the two largest table items every quarter and log the changes.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「不確定度預算與穩定度瓶頸」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Uncertainty budget and stability bottlenecks\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","鐘雷射的線寬只取決於二極體雷射本身的品質。","把鐘週期的死時間從 0.7 s 縮到 0.3 s 並量艾倫偏差，確認 1 s 穩定度依迪克效應模型改善。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","The clock laser's linewidth depends only on the quality of the diode laser itself.","Shorten the dead time from 0.7 s to 0.3 s and remeasure the Allan deviation, confirming that the 1 s stability improves as the Dick-effect model predicts."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把鐘週期的死時間從 0.7 s 縮到 0.3 s 並量艾倫偏差，確認 1 s 穩定度依迪克效應模型改善；以鐘雷射的量測相位雜訊譜代入迪克公式計算預期的穩定度，與量測值比較在 30% 內；每季重新評估預算表中最大的兩項並記錄變化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Shorten the dead time from 0.7 s to 0.3 s and remeasure the Allan deviation, confirming that the 1 s stability improves as the Dick-effect model predicts; feed the measured clock-laser phase-noise spectrum into the Dick formula and compare the predicted stability with measurement within 30%; re-evaluate the two largest table items every quarter and log the changes. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a435-v12-24","title":"不確定度預算與穩定度瓶頸：失效診斷","titleEn":"Uncertainty budget and stability bottlenecks: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「系統不確定度表與迪克效應」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Systematic-uncertainty table and the Dick effect” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"穩定度長期停在 5×10⁻¹⁶/√τ，團隊花一年改善原子數與晶格，卻沒有量鐘雷射的相位雜訊譜；最後發現腔的隔振平台失效，迪克效應放大了 1–10 Hz 的地面振動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Stability sits at 5×10⁻¹⁶/√τ for a year while the team improves atom number and lattice without measuring the clock laser's phase-noise spectrum; the cause turns out to be a failed vibration-isolation platform under the cavity, whose 1–10 Hz ground motion the Dick effect amplifies. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：預算表的另一個用途是指出哪一項值得投入：黑體輻射與晶格位移通常並列最大。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The table also shows where effort pays off: blackbody and lattice shifts are usually tied for largest.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「準確度與穩定度是同一件事，艾倫偏差小就代表鐘準。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Accuracy and stability are the same thing, so a small Allan deviation means the clock is accurate.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"穩定度長期停在 5×10⁻¹⁶/√τ，團隊花一年改善原子數與晶格，卻沒有量鐘雷射的相位雜訊譜；最後發現腔的隔振平台失效，迪克效應放大了 1–10 Hz 的地面振動。","textEn":"Stability sits at 5×10⁻¹⁶/√τ for a year while the team improves atom number and lattice without measuring the clock laser's phase-noise spectrum; the cause turns out to be a failed vibration-isolation platform under the cavity, whose 1–10 Hz ground motion the Dick effect amplifies.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「不確定度預算與穩定度瓶頸」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Uncertainty budget and stability bottlenecks\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["穩定度長期停在 5×10⁻¹⁶/√τ，團隊花一年改善原子數與晶格，卻沒有量鐘雷射的相位雜訊譜。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","單模光纖只是把光從 A 點送到 B 點，不會改變光的頻率。"],"optionsEn":["Stability sits at 5×10⁻¹⁶/√τ for a year while the team improves atom number and lattice without measuring the clock laser's phase-noise spectrum.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","A single-mode fibre merely moves light from A to B and cannot change its frequency."],"answer":0,"explanation":"穩定度長期停在 5×10⁻¹⁶/√τ，團隊花一年改善原子數與晶格，卻沒有量鐘雷射的相位雜訊譜；最後發現腔的隔振平台失效，迪克效應放大了 1–10 Hz 的地面振動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Stability sits at 5×10⁻¹⁶/√τ for a year while the team improves atom number and lattice without measuring the clock laser's phase-noise spectrum; the cause turns out to be a failed vibration-isolation platform under the cavity, whose 1–10 Hz ground motion the Dick effect amplifies. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a435-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「系統整合：光路、磁場、時序與環境」與「驗證、國際比對與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"System integration: optical paths, magnetic field, timing and environment\" and \"Validation, international comparison and engineering handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a435-v12-25","title":"系統整合：光路、磁場、時序與環境：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"System integration: optical paths, magnetic field, timing and environment: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「光纖雜訊消除與磁屏蔽」如何決定光學原子鐘真空與雷射系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Fibre-noise cancellation and magnetic shielding” determines the key performance of “Optical atomic-clock vacuum and laser systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"鐘雷射從腔到原子要走數公尺到數十公尺的光纖，光纖的熱與聲學相位雜訊會直接加到鐘頻率上，必須用往返干涉的主動光纖雜訊消除把參考面延伸到原子附近。磁場由三軸線圈與 µ 金屬屏蔽控制，偏置場要穩定到 µT 以下以壓低一階與二階季曼效應；時序由 FPGA 或實時控制器以 µs 精度排程冷卻、裝載、探測與偵測。冷卻光與晶格光的功率、頻率與偏振各自需要伺服，整個系統有數十個鎖迴路同時運作，任何一個失鎖都必須被自動偵測並觸發重鎖。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「光纖雜訊消除與磁屏蔽」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The clock laser travels metres to tens of metres of fibre from cavity to atoms, and the fibre's thermal and acoustic phase noise adds directly to the clock frequency, so active fibre-noise cancellation with a round-trip interferometer extends the reference plane to the atoms. The magnetic field is controlled by three-axis coils and mu-metal shielding, with the bias field stable below the microtesla level to suppress first- and second-order Zeeman effects; timing is scheduled by an FPGA or real-time controller with microsecond precision for cooling, loading, probing and detection. Power, frequency and polarization of cooling and lattice light each need their own servo, so dozens of lock loops run simultaneously and any loss of lock must be detected automatically and trigger a relock. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Fibre-noise cancellation and magnetic shielding”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：10 m 光纖、熱光係數 1×10⁻⁵/K：溫度變化 1 K 使光程變化 10 m×10⁻⁵ = 1×10⁻⁴ m，相位變化 2π×10⁻⁴/698×10⁻⁹ = 900 rad；若在 100 s 內發生，等效頻率偏移 900/(2π×100) = 1.43 Hz，相對值 1.43/429.228×10¹² = 3.3×10⁻¹⁵，比鐘的目標差三個數量級。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For 10 m of fibre with a thermo-optic coefficient of 1×10⁻⁵/K, a 1 K change alters the optical path by 10 m×10⁻⁵ = 1×10⁻⁴ m, a phase change of 2π×10⁻⁴/698×10⁻⁹ = 900 rad; occurring over 100 s this is an equivalent frequency offset of 900/(2π×100) = 1.43 Hz, fractionally 1.43/429.228×10¹² = 3.3×10⁻¹⁵, three orders beyond the clock's goal.","failure":"常見誤解：「單模光纖只是把光從 A 點送到 B 點，不會改變光的頻率。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A single-mode fibre merely moves light from A to B and cannot change its frequency.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「光纖雜訊消除與磁屏蔽」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Fibre-noise cancellation and magnetic shielding”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-25-k1","title":"系統整合：光路、磁場、時序與環境","titleEn":"System integration: optical paths, magnetic field, timing and environment","text":"鐘雷射從腔到原子要走數公尺到數十公尺的光纖，光纖的熱與聲學相位雜訊會直接加到鐘頻率上，必須用往返干涉的主動光纖雜訊消除把參考面延伸到原子附近。磁場由三軸線圈與 µ 金屬屏蔽控制，偏置場要穩定到 µT 以下以壓低一階與二階季曼效應；時序由 FPGA 或實時控制器以 µs 精度排程冷卻、裝載、探測與偵測。","textEn":"The clock laser travels metres to tens of metres of fibre from cavity to atoms, and the fibre's thermal and acoustic phase noise adds directly to the clock frequency, so active fibre-noise cancellation with a round-trip interferometer extends the reference plane to the atoms. The magnetic field is controlled by three-axis coils and mu-metal shielding, with the bias field stable below the microtesla level to suppress first- and second-order Zeeman effects; timing is scheduled by an FPGA or real-time controller with microsecond precision for cooling, loading, probing and detection.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：單模光纖只是把光從 A 點送到 B 點，不會改變光的頻率。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A single-mode fibre merely moves light from A to B and cannot change its frequency. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「系統整合：光路、磁場、時序與環境」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"System integration: optical paths, magnetic field, timing and environment\" is correct?","options":["單模光纖只是把光從 A 點送到 B 點，不會改變光的頻率。","鐘雷射從腔到原子要走數公尺到數十公尺的光纖，光纖的熱與聲學相位雜訊會直接加到鐘頻率上，必須用往返干涉的主動光纖雜訊消除把參考面延伸到原子附近。","一台鐘的系統不確定度表做完一次，就能永久代表它的準確度。"],"optionsEn":["A single-mode fibre merely moves light from A to B and cannot change its frequency.","The clock laser travels metres to tens of metres of fibre from cavity to atoms, and the fibre's thermal and acoustic phase noise adds directly to the clock frequency, so active fibre-noise cancellation with a round-trip interferometer extends the reference plane to the atoms.","Once a clock's systematic table is completed, it represents the clock's accuracy permanently."],"answer":1,"explanation":"鐘雷射從腔到原子要走數公尺到數十公尺的光纖，光纖的熱與聲學相位雜訊會直接加到鐘頻率上，必須用往返干涉的主動光纖雜訊消除把參考面延伸到原子附近。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The clock laser travels metres to tens of metres of fibre from cavity to atoms, and the fibre's thermal and acoustic phase noise adds directly to the clock frequency, so active fibre-noise cancellation with a round-trip interferometer extends the reference plane to the atoms. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a435-v12-26","title":"系統整合：光路、磁場、時序與環境：定量估算","titleEn":"System integration: optical paths, magnetic field, timing and environment: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「光纖雜訊消除與磁屏蔽」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Fibre-noise cancellation and magnetic shielding” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：10 m 光纖、熱光係數 1×10⁻⁵/K：溫度變化 1 K 使光程變化 10 m×10⁻⁵ = 1×10⁻⁴ m，相位變化 2π×10⁻⁴/698×10⁻⁹ = 900 rad；若在 100 s 內發生，等效頻率偏移 900/(2π×100) = 1.43 Hz，相對值 1.43/429.228×10¹² = 3.3×10⁻¹⁵，比鐘的目標差三個數量級。開啟光纖雜訊消除後殘餘通常低於 10⁻¹⁸，但往返路徑外的最後一段自由空間光路（約 0.3 m）仍須機械穩固。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For 10 m of fibre with a thermo-optic coefficient of 1×10⁻⁵/K, a 1 K change alters the optical path by 10 m×10⁻⁵ = 1×10⁻⁴ m, a phase change of 2π×10⁻⁴/698×10⁻⁹ = 900 rad; occurring over 100 s this is an equivalent frequency offset of 900/(2π×100) = 1.43 Hz, fractionally 1.43/429.228×10¹² = 3.3×10⁻¹⁵, three orders beyond the clock's goal. With fibre-noise cancellation on, the residual is usually below 10⁻¹⁸, but the last free-space stretch outside the round-trip path (about 0.3 m) still needs mechanical rigidity. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用往返拍頻在消除開啟與關閉時各計數 1000 s，確認關閉時的 10⁻¹⁵ 級漂移在開啟後低於 10⁻¹⁸；以磁通計在原子位置量三軸場並掃描屏蔽開口方向，確認殘餘場穩定度優於 0.1 µT；最後做一次「全系統拔插」測試：關閉再開啟實驗室照明與空調，確認所有迴路在 60 s 內自動恢復。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Count the round-trip beat for 1000 s with cancellation on and off, confirming that the 10⁻¹⁵-level drift when off falls below 10⁻¹⁸ when on; measure the three-axis field at the atom position with a fluxgate magnetometer, scanning the orientation of the shield openings, and confirm residual-field stability better than 0.1 µT; finally run a whole-system disturbance test by switching the laboratory lighting and air-conditioning off and on and confirming that every loop recovers automatically within 60 s.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"10 m 光纖、熱光係數 1×10⁻⁵/K：溫度變化 1 K 使光程變化 10 m×10⁻⁵ = 1×10⁻⁴ m，相位變化 2π×10⁻⁴/698×10⁻⁹ = 900 rad；若在 100 s 內發生，等效頻率偏移 900/(2π×100) = 1.43 Hz，相對值 1.43/429.228×10¹² = 3.3×10⁻¹⁵，比鐘的目標差三個數量級。開啟光纖雜訊消除後殘餘通常低於 10⁻¹⁸，但往返路徑外的最後一段自由空間光路（約 0.3 m）仍須機械穩固。","textEn":"For 10 m of fibre with a thermo-optic coefficient of 1×10⁻⁵/K, a 1 K change alters the optical path by 10 m×10⁻⁵ = 1×10⁻⁴ m, a phase change of 2π×10⁻⁴/698×10⁻⁹ = 900 rad; occurring over 100 s this is an equivalent frequency offset of 900/(2π×100) = 1.43 Hz, fractionally 1.43/429.228×10¹² = 3.3×10⁻¹⁵, three orders beyond the clock's goal. With fibre-noise cancellation on, the residual is usually below 10⁻¹⁸, but the last free-space stretch outside the round-trip path (about 0.3 m) still needs mechanical rigidity.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「系統整合：光路、磁場、時序與環境」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"System integration: optical paths, magnetic field, timing and environment\", which statement holds?","options":["只要原子夠冷，不用晶格也能用秒級探測得到 Hz 級線寬。","鐘雷射的線寬只取決於二極體雷射本身的品質。","10 m 光纖、熱光係數 1×10⁻⁵/K：溫度變化 1 K 使光程變化 10 m×10⁻⁵ = 1×10⁻⁴ m，相位變化 2π×10⁻⁴/698×10⁻⁹ = 900 rad。"],"optionsEn":["Cold enough atoms give hertz-level linewidths with second-long probes even without a lattice.","The clock laser's linewidth depends only on the quality of the diode laser itself.","For 10 m of fibre with a thermo-optic coefficient of 1×10⁻⁵/K, a 1 K change alters the optical path by 10 m×10⁻⁵ = 1×10⁻⁴ m, a phase change of 2π×10⁻⁴/698×10⁻⁹ = 900 rad."],"answer":2,"explanation":"10 m 光纖、熱光係數 1×10⁻⁵/K：溫度變化 1 K 使光程變化 10 m×10⁻⁵ = 1×10⁻⁴ m，相位變化 2π×10⁻⁴/698×10⁻⁹ = 900 rad；若在 100 s 內發生，等效頻率偏移 900/(2π×100) = 1.43 Hz，相對值 1.43/429.228×10¹² = 3.3×10⁻¹⁵，比鐘的目標差三個數量級。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For 10 m of fibre with a thermo-optic coefficient of 1×10⁻⁵/K, a 1 K change alters the optical path by 10 m×10⁻⁵ = 1×10⁻⁴ m, a phase change of 2π×10⁻⁴/698×10⁻⁹ = 900 rad; occurring over 100 s this is an equivalent frequency offset of 900/(2π×100) = 1.43 Hz, fractionally 1.43/429.228×10¹² = 3.3×10⁻¹⁵, three orders beyond the clock's goal. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a435-v12-27","title":"系統整合：光路、磁場、時序與環境：量測與驗證","titleEn":"System integration: optical paths, magnetic field, timing and environment: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「光纖雜訊消除與磁屏蔽」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Fibre-noise cancellation and magnetic shielding” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用往返拍頻在消除開啟與關閉時各計數 1000 s，確認關閉時的 10⁻¹⁵ 級漂移在開啟後低於 10⁻¹⁸；以磁通計在原子位置量三軸場並掃描屏蔽開口方向，確認殘餘場穩定度優於 0.1 µT；最後做一次「全系統拔插」測試：關閉再開啟實驗室照明與空調，確認所有迴路在 60 s 內自動恢復。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Count the round-trip beat for 1000 s with cancellation on and off, confirming that the 10⁻¹⁵-level drift when off falls below 10⁻¹⁸ when on; measure the three-axis field at the atom position with a fluxgate magnetometer, scanning the orientation of the shield openings, and confirm residual-field stability better than 0.1 µT; finally run a whole-system disturbance test by switching the laboratory lighting and air-conditioning off and on and confirming that every loop recovers automatically within 60 s. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：光纖雜訊消除的參考反射面放在光纖末端而非原子附近的自由空間鏡，最後一段 1 m 的光路經過一台風扇冷卻的放大器，2 Hz 的氣流相位調制讓鐘的 1 s 穩定度惡化三倍且出現週期性結構。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Placing the fibre-noise-cancellation reference reflector at the fibre end rather than on a free-space mirror near the atoms leaves the last metre of path passing a fan-cooled amplifier, whose 2 Hz airflow phase modulation triples the clock's 1 s instability and adds periodic structure.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用往返拍頻在消除開啟與關閉時各計數 1000 s，確認關閉時的 10⁻¹⁵ 級漂移在開啟後低於 10⁻¹⁸；以磁通計在原子位置量三軸場並掃描屏蔽開口方向，確認殘餘場穩定度優於 0.1 µT；最後做一次「全系統拔插」測試：關閉再開啟實驗室照明與空調，確認所有迴路在 60 s 內自動恢復。","textEn":"Count the round-trip beat for 1000 s with cancellation on and off, confirming that the 10⁻¹⁵-level drift when off falls below 10⁻¹⁸ when on; measure the three-axis field at the atom position with a fluxgate magnetometer, scanning the orientation of the shield openings, and confirm residual-field stability better than 0.1 µT; finally run a whole-system disturbance test by switching the laboratory lighting and air-conditioning off and on and confirming that every loop recovers automatically within 60 s.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「系統整合：光路、磁場、時序與環境」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"System integration: optical paths, magnetic field, timing and environment\"?","options":["用往返拍頻在消除開啟與關閉時各計數 1000 s，確認關閉時的 10⁻¹⁵ 級漂移在開啟後低於 10⁻¹⁸。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要實驗室溫度控制在 ±0.5 °C，黑體輻射位移就可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["Count the round-trip beat for 1000 s with cancellation on and off, confirming that the 10⁻¹⁵-level drift when off falls below 10⁻¹⁸ when on.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","With the laboratory held to ±0.5 °C, the blackbody-radiation shift can be ignored."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用往返拍頻在消除開啟與關閉時各計數 1000 s，確認關閉時的 10⁻¹⁵ 級漂移在開啟後低於 10⁻¹⁸；以磁通計在原子位置量三軸場並掃描屏蔽開口方向，確認殘餘場穩定度優於 0.1 µT；最後做一次「全系統拔插」測試：關閉再開啟實驗室照明與空調，確認所有迴路在 60 s 內自動恢復。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Count the round-trip beat for 1000 s with cancellation on and off, confirming that the 10⁻¹⁵-level drift when off falls below 10⁻¹⁸ when on; measure the three-axis field at the atom position with a fluxgate magnetometer, scanning the orientation of the shield openings, and confirm residual-field stability better than 0.1 µT; finally run a whole-system disturbance test by switching the laboratory lighting and air-conditioning off and on and confirming that every loop recovers automatically within 60 s. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a435-v12-28","title":"系統整合：光路、磁場、時序與環境：失效診斷","titleEn":"System integration: optical paths, magnetic field, timing and environment: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「光纖雜訊消除與磁屏蔽」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Fibre-noise cancellation and magnetic shielding” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"光纖雜訊消除的參考反射面放在光纖末端而非原子附近的自由空間鏡，最後一段 1 m 的光路經過一台風扇冷卻的放大器，2 Hz 的氣流相位調制讓鐘的 1 s 穩定度惡化三倍且出現週期性結構。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Placing the fibre-noise-cancellation reference reflector at the fibre end rather than on a free-space mirror near the atoms leaves the last metre of path passing a fan-cooled amplifier, whose 2 Hz airflow phase modulation triples the clock's 1 s instability and adds periodic structure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：冷卻光與晶格光的功率、頻率與偏振各自需要伺服，整個系統有數十個鎖迴路同時運作，任何一個失鎖都必須被自動偵測並觸發重鎖。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Power, frequency and polarization of cooling and lattice light each need their own servo, so dozens of lock loops run simultaneously and any loss of lock must be detected automatically and trigger a relock.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「單模光纖只是把光從 A 點送到 B 點，不會改變光的頻率。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A single-mode fibre merely moves light from A to B and cannot change its frequency.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"光纖雜訊消除的參考反射面放在光纖末端而非原子附近的自由空間鏡，最後一段 1 m 的光路經過一台風扇冷卻的放大器，2 Hz 的氣流相位調制讓鐘的 1 s 穩定度惡化三倍且出現週期性結構。","textEn":"Placing the fibre-noise-cancellation reference reflector at the fibre end rather than on a free-space mirror near the atoms leaves the last metre of path passing a fan-cooled amplifier, whose 2 Hz airflow phase modulation triples the clock's 1 s instability and adds periodic structure.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「系統整合：光路、磁場、時序與環境」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"System integration: optical paths, magnetic field, timing and environment\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","光纖雜訊消除的參考反射面放在光纖末端而非原子附近的自由空間鏡，最後一段 1 m 的光路經過一台風扇冷卻的放大器，2 Hz 的氣流相位調制讓鐘的 1 s 穩定度惡化三倍且出現週期性結構。","一台鐘的系統不確定度表做完一次，就能永久代表它的準確度。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Placing the fibre-noise-cancellation reference reflector at the fibre end rather than on a free-space mirror near the atoms leaves the last metre of path passing a fan-cooled amplifier, whose 2 Hz airflow phase modulation triples the clock's 1 s instability and adds periodic structure.","Once a clock's systematic table is completed, it represents the clock's accuracy permanently."],"answer":1,"explanation":"光纖雜訊消除的參考反射面放在光纖末端而非原子附近的自由空間鏡，最後一段 1 m 的光路經過一台風扇冷卻的放大器，2 Hz 的氣流相位調制讓鐘的 1 s 穩定度惡化三倍且出現週期性結構。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Placing the fibre-noise-cancellation reference reflector at the fibre end rather than on a free-space mirror near the atoms leaves the last metre of path passing a fan-cooled amplifier, whose 2 Hz airflow phase modulation triples the clock's 1 s instability and adds periodic structure. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a435-v12-29","title":"驗證、國際比對與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Validation, international comparison and engineering handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「鐘比對、頻率比值與交接文件」如何決定光學原子鐘真空與雷射系統的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Clock comparison, frequency ratios and handoff file” determines the key performance of “Optical atomic-clock vacuum and laser systems”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"一台光鐘的準確度宣稱只有透過與其他鐘比對才算被驗證：同一實驗室的第二台鐘（同種或異種原子，透過頻率梳量頻率比值）、藉由光纖鏈路或衛星連接的其他國家實驗室的鐘、以及與銫噴泉鐘比對以得到對 SI 秒的絕對頻率。比對結果以頻率比值與其不確定度呈現，並與各鐘的系統不確定度表核對一致性。交接文件應包含：真空系統的放氣與壓力紀錄、所有雷射的鎖定參數與功率、位移表與其量測日期、溫度計校正證書、光纖雜訊消除的驗證資料，以及連續運轉時數與失鎖事件紀錄。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「鐘比對、頻率比值與交接文件」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A clock's accuracy claim counts as validated only through comparison with other clocks: a second clock in the same laboratory (same or different species, with the frequency ratio measured through a comb), clocks at other national laboratories linked by fibre or satellite, and a caesium fountain to obtain the absolute frequency against the SI second. Results are reported as frequency ratios with uncertainties and checked for consistency with each clock's systematic table. The handoff file should contain the vacuum system's outgassing and pressure logs, every laser's lock parameters and powers, the shift table with measurement dates, thermometer calibration certificates, the fibre-noise-cancellation validation data, and the record of continuous operating hours and loss-of-lock events. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Clock comparison, frequency ratios and handoff file”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：兩台鐘比對的合成穩定度 σ_y(τ) = 3×10⁻¹⁶/√τ（教學假設）：要把統計不確定度平均到 1×10⁻¹⁸，需 τ = (3×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 9×10⁴ s = 25 小時的有效資料；若鐘的運轉率只有 50%，就需要兩天以上。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Two clocks compared with a combined stability σ_y(τ) = 3×10⁻¹⁶/√τ (teaching assumption) need τ = (3×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 9×10⁴ s = 25 hours of valid data to average the statistical uncertainty to 1×10⁻¹⁸; at 50% uptime that is more than two days.","failure":"常見誤解：「一台鐘的系統不確定度表做完一次，就能永久代表它的準確度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once a clock's systematic table is completed, it represents the clock's accuracy permanently.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「鐘比對、頻率比值與交接文件」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Clock comparison, frequency ratios and handoff file”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-29-k1","title":"驗證、國際比對與工程交接","titleEn":"Validation, international comparison and engineering handoff","text":"一台光鐘的準確度宣稱只有透過與其他鐘比對才算被驗證：同一實驗室的第二台鐘（同種或異種原子，透過頻率梳量頻率比值）、藉由光纖鏈路或衛星連接的其他國家實驗室的鐘、以及與銫噴泉鐘比對以得到對 SI 秒的絕對頻率。比對結果以頻率比值與其不確定度呈現，並與各鐘的系統不確定度表核對一致性。","textEn":"A clock's accuracy claim counts as validated only through comparison with other clocks: a second clock in the same laboratory (same or different species, with the frequency ratio measured through a comb), clocks at other national laboratories linked by fibre or satellite, and a caesium fountain to obtain the absolute frequency against the SI second. Results are reported as frequency ratios with uncertainties and checked for consistency with each clock's systematic table.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：一台鐘的系統不確定度表做完一次，就能永久代表它的準確度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once a clock's systematic table is completed, it represents the clock's accuracy permanently. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「驗證、國際比對與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Validation, international comparison and engineering handoff\" is correct?","options":["一台鐘的系統不確定度表做完一次，就能永久代表它的準確度。","光鐘比銫鐘準是因為雷射比微波源更穩定。","一台光鐘的準確度宣稱只有透過與其他鐘比對才算被驗證：同一實驗室的第二台鐘（同種或異種原子，透過頻率梳量頻率比值）、藉由光纖鏈路或衛星連接的其他國家實驗室的鐘、以及與銫噴泉鐘比對以得到對 SI 秒的絕對頻率。"],"optionsEn":["Once a clock's systematic table is completed, it represents the clock's accuracy permanently.","Optical clocks beat caesium clocks because lasers are more stable than microwave sources.","A clock's accuracy claim counts as validated only through comparison with other clocks: a second clock in the same laboratory (same or different species, with the frequency ratio measured through a comb), clocks at other national laboratories linked by fibre or satellite, and a caesium fountain to obtain the absolute frequency against the SI second."],"answer":2,"explanation":"一台光鐘的準確度宣稱只有透過與其他鐘比對才算被驗證：同一實驗室的第二台鐘（同種或異種原子，透過頻率梳量頻率比值）、藉由光纖鏈路或衛星連接的其他國家實驗室的鐘、以及與銫噴泉鐘比對以得到對 SI 秒的絕對頻率。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A clock's accuracy claim counts as validated only through comparison with other clocks: a second clock in the same laboratory (same or different species, with the frequency ratio measured through a comb), clocks at other national laboratories linked by fibre or satellite, and a caesium fountain to obtain the absolute frequency against the SI second. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a435-v12-30","title":"驗證、國際比對與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Validation, international comparison and engineering handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「鐘比對、頻率比值與交接文件」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Clock comparison, frequency ratios and handoff file” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：兩台鐘比對的合成穩定度 σ_y(τ) = 3×10⁻¹⁶/√τ（教學假設）：要把統計不確定度平均到 1×10⁻¹⁸，需 τ = (3×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 9×10⁴ s = 25 小時的有效資料；若鐘的運轉率只有 50%，就需要兩天以上。比對結果若差 2×10⁻¹⁸，而兩鐘系統不確定度各為 1×10⁻¹⁸，合成 1.4×10⁻¹⁸，差異為 1.4σ，尚可接受；差 5×10⁻¹⁸ 則表示某張位移表有遺漏。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Two clocks compared with a combined stability σ_y(τ) = 3×10⁻¹⁶/√τ (teaching assumption) need τ = (3×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 9×10⁴ s = 25 hours of valid data to average the statistical uncertainty to 1×10⁻¹⁸; at 50% uptime that is more than two days. A 2×10⁻¹⁸ difference against systematic uncertainties of 1×10⁻¹⁸ each (combined 1.4×10⁻¹⁸) is 1.4σ and acceptable; a 5×10⁻¹⁸ difference means some shift table is missing an item. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：安排一次至少 48 小時的連續比對：記錄每秒的頻率比值、兩鐘的所有伺服與環境監測值；剔除失鎖段後計算艾倫偏差與平均值，確認統計不確定度到達 10⁻¹⁸ 且差異在合成系統不確定度的 2 倍內；把比對報告、位移表與運轉紀錄一併歸檔作為交接基準。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Schedule a continuous comparison of at least 48 hours, logging the frequency ratio every second together with all servo and environmental monitors of both clocks; after removing loss-of-lock segments compute the Allan deviation and mean, confirm that the statistical uncertainty reaches 10⁻¹⁸ and that the difference lies within twice the combined systematic uncertainty; archive the comparison report, shift tables and operating log as the handoff baseline.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"兩台鐘比對的合成穩定度 σ_y(τ) = 3×10⁻¹⁶/√τ（教學假設）：要把統計不確定度平均到 1×10⁻¹⁸，需 τ = (3×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 9×10⁴ s = 25 小時的有效資料；若鐘的運轉率只有 50%，就需要兩天以上。比對結果若差 2×10⁻¹⁸，而兩鐘系統不確定度各為 1×10⁻¹⁸，合成 1.4×10⁻¹⁸，差異為 1.4σ，尚可接受；差 5×10⁻¹⁸ 則表示某張位移表有遺漏。","textEn":"Two clocks compared with a combined stability σ_y(τ) = 3×10⁻¹⁶/√τ (teaching assumption) need τ = (3×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 9×10⁴ s = 25 hours of valid data to average the statistical uncertainty to 1×10⁻¹⁸; at 50% uptime that is more than two days. A 2×10⁻¹⁸ difference against systematic uncertainties of 1×10⁻¹⁸ each (combined 1.4×10⁻¹⁸) is 1.4σ and acceptable; a 5×10⁻¹⁸ difference means some shift table is missing an item.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「驗證、國際比對與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Validation, international comparison and engineering handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["兩台鐘比對的合成穩定度 σ_y(τ) = 3×10⁻¹⁶/√τ（教學假設）：要把統計不確定度平均到 1×10⁻¹⁸，需 τ = (3×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 9×10⁴ s = 25 小時的有效資料。","真空只要「夠低」讓原子不被碰掉就好，對鐘的準確度沒有直接影響。","只要實驗室溫度控制在 ±0.5 °C，黑體輻射位移就可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["Two clocks compared with a combined stability σ_y(τ) = 3×10⁻¹⁶/√τ (teaching assumption) need τ = (3×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 9×10⁴ s = 25 hours of valid data to average the statistical uncertainty to 1×10⁻¹⁸.","Vacuum only needs to be low enough to keep atoms from being knocked out and has no direct effect on clock accuracy.","With the laboratory held to ±0.5 °C, the blackbody-radiation shift can be ignored."],"answer":0,"explanation":"兩台鐘比對的合成穩定度 σ_y(τ) = 3×10⁻¹⁶/√τ（教學假設）：要把統計不確定度平均到 1×10⁻¹⁸，需 τ = (3×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 9×10⁴ s = 25 小時的有效資料；若鐘的運轉率只有 50%，就需要兩天以上。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Two clocks compared with a combined stability σ_y(τ) = 3×10⁻¹⁶/√τ (teaching assumption) need τ = (3×10⁻¹⁶/10⁻¹⁸)² = 9×10⁴ s = 25 hours of valid data to average the statistical uncertainty to 1×10⁻¹⁸; at 50% uptime that is more than two days. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a435-v12-31","title":"驗證、國際比對與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Validation, international comparison and engineering handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「鐘比對、頻率比值與交接文件」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Clock comparison, frequency ratios and handoff file” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"安排一次至少 48 小時的連續比對：記錄每秒的頻率比值、兩鐘的所有伺服與環境監測值；剔除失鎖段後計算艾倫偏差與平均值，確認統計不確定度到達 10⁻¹⁸ 且差異在合成系統不確定度的 2 倍內；把比對報告、位移表與運轉紀錄一併歸檔作為交接基準。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Schedule a continuous comparison of at least 48 hours, logging the frequency ratio every second together with all servo and environmental monitors of both clocks; after removing loss-of-lock segments compute the Allan deviation and mean, confirm that the statistical uncertainty reaches 10⁻¹⁸ and that the difference lies within twice the combined systematic uncertainty; archive the comparison report, shift tables and operating log as the handoff baseline. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：位移表沿用兩年前的黑體輻射評估，期間腔體加裝了一支 30 °C 的加熱視窗卻沒有重新評估有效溫度；比對時出現 8×10⁻¹⁸ 的偏差，整份準確度宣稱必須撤回重做。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: The shift table reuses a two-year-old blackbody evaluation although a 30 °C heated viewport was added to the chamber without re-evaluating the effective temperature; the comparison reveals an 8×10⁻¹⁸ offset and the entire accuracy claim has to be withdrawn and redone.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"安排一次至少 48 小時的連續比對：記錄每秒的頻率比值、兩鐘的所有伺服與環境監測值；剔除失鎖段後計算艾倫偏差與平均值，確認統計不確定度到達 10⁻¹⁸ 且差異在合成系統不確定度的 2 倍內；把比對報告、位移表與運轉紀錄一併歸檔作為交接基準。","textEn":"Schedule a continuous comparison of at least 48 hours, logging the frequency ratio every second together with all servo and environmental monitors of both clocks; after removing loss-of-lock segments compute the Allan deviation and mean, confirm that the statistical uncertainty reaches 10⁻¹⁸ and that the difference lies within twice the combined systematic uncertainty; archive the comparison report, shift tables and operating log as the handoff baseline.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「驗證、國際比對與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Validation, international comparison and engineering handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","安排一次至少 48 小時的連續比對：記錄每秒的頻率比值、兩鐘的所有伺服與環境監測值。","準確度與穩定度是同一件事，艾倫偏差小就代表鐘準。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Schedule a continuous comparison of at least 48 hours, logging the frequency ratio every second together with all servo and environmental monitors of both clocks.","Accuracy and stability are the same thing, so a small Allan deviation means the clock is accurate."],"answer":1,"explanation":"安排一次至少 48 小時的連續比對：記錄每秒的頻率比值、兩鐘的所有伺服與環境監測值；剔除失鎖段後計算艾倫偏差與平均值，確認統計不確定度到達 10⁻¹⁸ 且差異在合成系統不確定度的 2 倍內；把比對報告、位移表與運轉紀錄一併歸檔作為交接基準。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Schedule a continuous comparison of at least 48 hours, logging the frequency ratio every second together with all servo and environmental monitors of both clocks; after removing loss-of-lock segments compute the Allan deviation and mean, confirm that the statistical uncertainty reaches 10⁻¹⁸ and that the difference lies within twice the combined systematic uncertainty; archive the comparison report, shift tables and operating log as the handoff baseline. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a435-v12-32","title":"驗證、國際比對與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Validation, international comparison and engineering handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"prerequisiteIds":["a435-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「鐘比對、頻率比值與交接文件」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Clock comparison, frequency ratios and handoff file” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"位移表沿用兩年前的黑體輻射評估，期間腔體加裝了一支 30 °C 的加熱視窗卻沒有重新評估有效溫度；比對時出現 8×10⁻¹⁸ 的偏差，整份準確度宣稱必須撤回重做。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"The shift table reuses a two-year-old blackbody evaluation although a 30 °C heated viewport was added to the chamber without re-evaluating the effective temperature; the comparison reveals an 8×10⁻¹⁸ offset and the entire accuracy claim has to be withdrawn and redone. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接文件應包含：真空系統的放氣與壓力紀錄、所有雷射的鎖定參數與功率、位移表與其量測日期、溫度計校正證書、光纖雜訊消除的驗證資料，以及連續運轉時數與失鎖事件紀錄。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff file should contain the vacuum system's outgassing and pressure logs, every laser's lock parameters and powers, the shift table with measurement dates, thermometer calibration certificates, the fibre-noise-cancellation validation data, and the record of continuous operating hours and loss-of-lock events.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「一台鐘的系統不確定度表做完一次，就能永久代表它的準確度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once a clock's systematic table is completed, it represents the clock's accuracy permanently.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a435-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"位移表沿用兩年前的黑體輻射評估，期間腔體加裝了一支 30 °C 的加熱視窗卻沒有重新評估有效溫度；比對時出現 8×10⁻¹⁸ 的偏差，整份準確度宣稱必須撤回重做。","textEn":"The shift table reuses a two-year-old blackbody evaluation although a 30 °C heated viewport was added to the chamber without re-evaluating the effective temperature; the comparison reveals an 8×10⁻¹⁸ offset and the entire accuracy claim has to be withdrawn and redone.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]},{"id":"a435-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「驗證、國際比對與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Validation, international comparison and engineering handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","光鐘比銫鐘準是因為雷射比微波源更穩定。","位移表沿用兩年前的黑體輻射評估，期間腔體加裝了一支 30 °C 的加熱視窗卻沒有重新評估有效溫度。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Optical clocks beat caesium clocks because lasers are more stable than microwave sources.","The shift table reuses a two-year-old blackbody evaluation although a 30 °C heated viewport was added to the chamber without re-evaluating the effective temperature."],"answer":2,"explanation":"位移表沿用兩年前的黑體輻射評估，期間腔體加裝了一支 30 °C 的加熱視窗卻沒有重新評估有效溫度；比對時出現 8×10⁻¹⁸ 的偏差，整份準確度宣稱必須撤回重做。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"The shift table reuses a two-year-old blackbody evaluation although a 30 °C heated viewport was added to the chamber without re-evaluating the effective temperature; the comparison reveals an 8×10⁻¹⁸ offset and the entire accuracy claim has to be withdrawn and redone. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-nist-yb-optical-lattice-clock","v12o-nist-optical-clocks-future-of-time","v12o-ptb-optical-lattice-clocks-432","v12o-stable-laser-systems-clocks"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
